(179379, 10300, 3102, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Dorothy from the Wizard of Oz :)  Nicely done!</td>', 'Reminds me of Dorothy from the Wizard of Oz :)  Nicely done!', '2002-12-30 00:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(179380, 10315, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a very well executed pet portrait... i didn''t think i would give any tens for pets but you get one... great work... - setzler</td>', 'this is a very well executed pet portrait... i didn''t think i would give any tens for pets but you get one... great work... - setzler', '2002-12-30 00:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(179381, 10155, 2170, '<td valign="top">Love the cropping and the simple border.  Very clean and well done.</td>', 'Love the cropping and the simple border.  Very clean and well done.', '2002-12-30 00:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(179382, 10326, 4007, '<td valign="top">Nice, crisp shot.  Looks a little bit like it should be going onto a romance novel cover, (a bit cliche looking) which turns me off somewhat. not bad overall. 6</td>', 'Nice, crisp shot.  Looks a little bit like it should be going onto a romance novel cover, (a bit cliche looking) which turns me off somewhat. not bad overall. 6', '2002-12-30 00:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(179383, 10193, 4648, '<td valign="top">Georgeous cat.  What kind is it.  Oh, the woman is pretty too.  But, being another woman, I love the cat.  Looks very much like my Maine Coon.  This is a beautiful shot.  Very clean focus.  Maybe just a little dark.  You shuld have shown a little more of the cat, or was there too much on the table?  Would be an 8 in my book.  PTL</td>', 'Georgeous cat.  What kind is it.  Oh, the woman is pretty too.  But, being another woman, I love the cat.  Looks very much like my Maine Coon.  This is a beautiful shot.  Very clean focus.  Maybe just a little dark.  You shuld have shown a little more of the cat, or was there too much on the table?  Would be an 8 in my book.  PTL', '2002-12-30 00:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(179386, 10297, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Boston Terrier.  They''re perfect for a B&amp;W photo.  Very clear and good close up.  Beautiful standing ears.  Beautiful muzzel.  Wait, I''m not at a dog show.  But the same can be said of the photo.  This is a 10 in my book.  Great job.  PTL</td>', 'Beautiful Boston Terrier.  They''re perfect for a B&W photo.  Very clear and good close up.  Beautiful standing ears.  Beautiful muzzel.  Wait, I''m not at a dog show.  But the same can be said of the photo.  This is a 10 in my book.  Great job.  PTL', '2002-12-30 00:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(179387, 10226, 4007, '<td valign="top">interesting idea, but this picture doesn''t seem very visually appealing to me. The background (which makes up much of the shot) is uninteresting and somewhat distracting. The facial expression is good.  I''m not sure if a dog''s perspective was the best choice for a portrait shot, but I''ll credit you for being more unique than most entries. 5</td>', 'interesting idea, but this picture doesn''t seem very visually appealing to me. The background (which makes up much of the shot) is uninteresting and somewhat distracting. The facial expression is good.  I''m not sure if a dog''s perspective was the best choice for a portrait shot, but I''ll credit you for being more unique than most entries. 5', '2002-12-30 00:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(179388, 10115, 772, '<td valign="top">Great self portrait Remie... - 10 - setzler</td>', 'Great self portrait Remie... - 10 - setzler', '2002-12-30 00:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(179391, 10270, 4648, '<td valign="top">How in the world did you ever get the cat to pose like that?  As soon as I grab my camera mine gets up and moves.  This is perfect.  The focus is perfect.  Wonderful macro.  Don''t guess you could get rid of his toy from the front could you?  That''s my only problem, and it''s not that much.  I''d still give it a 9.  PTL</td>', 'How in the world did you ever get the cat to pose like that?  As soon as I grab my camera mine gets up and moves.  This is perfect.  The focus is perfect.  Wonderful macro.  Don''t guess you could get rid of his toy from the front could you?  That''s my only problem, and it''s not that much.  I''d still give it a 9.  PTL', '2002-12-30 00:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(179392, 10186, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting photo but it doesn''t qualify as a portrait for me... - setzler</td>', 'interesting photo but it doesn''t qualify as a portrait for me... - setzler', '2002-12-30 00:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(179393, 10179, 4007, '<td valign="top">Looks like a flash was used, and I think the shot would have looked better with a different light source.  The angle and the way the glasses are positioned I can''t tell if she is looking down or sleeping.  There doesn''t seem to be enough contrast on the face itself, which I think goes back to the light source again.  Framing seems to work pretty well. 4</td>', 'Looks like a flash was used, and I think the shot would have looked better with a different light source.  The angle and the way the glasses are positioned I can''t tell if she is looking down or sleeping.  There doesn''t seem to be enough contrast on the face itself, which I think goes back to the light source again.  Framing seems to work pretty well. 4', '2002-12-30 00:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(179400, 10324, 4648, '<td valign="top">Needs to be lightened some.  But then I realize the cat is dark.  I love the white whiskers in contrast against his dark fur.  Really makes them stand out.  Beautiful expression in the eyes....like.."hurry up cause I''m getting tired of this and gonna run."  Nice macro with good dof.  Just a hair lighter is all it need.  I''d give it an 8. PTL</td>', 'Needs to be lightened some.  But then I realize the cat is dark.  I love the white whiskers in contrast against his dark fur.  Really makes them stand out.  Beautiful expression in the eyes....like.."hurry up cause I''m getting tired of this and gonna run."  Nice macro with good dof.  Just a hair lighter is all it need.  I''d give it an 8. PTL', '2002-12-30 00:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(179401, 10218, 4007, '<td valign="top">The black and white of the blanket don''t seem to work well along with the plain grey background.  If one or the other were present I think it would work better.  As is it seems to turn the top left corner into cluttered space instead of negative space.  Good expression and a cute kid. 6</td>', 'The black and white of the blanket don''t seem to work well along with the plain grey background.  If one or the other were present I think it would work better.  As is it seems to turn the top left corner into cluttered space instead of negative space.  Good expression and a cute kid. 6', '2002-12-30 00:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(179406, 10315, 4648, '<td valign="top">You got that right about the eyes.  What colors are they.  Looks like yellow and maybe blue.  Am I wrong but is the right eye a little more dialated than the other?  Maybe just the way the flash went off.  Beautiful close up.  Beautiful cat, and beautiful photo.  It''d be an 8 with me.  PTL</td>', 'You got that right about the eyes.  What colors are they.  Looks like yellow and maybe blue.  Am I wrong but is the right eye a little more dialated than the other?  Maybe just the way the flash went off.  Beautiful close up.  Beautiful cat, and beautiful photo.  It''d be an 8 with me.  PTL', '2002-12-30 00:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(179411, 10136, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what effect I''m looking at here, but it''s simply too abstract for me.  There is a bit of a face in the middle, but not enough to see an expression or get a sense of meaning from the face.  I don''t see how the face connects with the surrounding streaks of black and white or what purpose the effect serves.  I personally don''t mind a distorted effect on a face, but I''d like to still be able to find some meaning or expression on that face, and see how or why it is distorted by some effect. 3</td>', 'I''m not sure what effect I''m looking at here, but it''s simply too abstract for me.  There is a bit of a face in the middle, but not enough to see an expression or get a sense of meaning from the face.  I don''t see how the face connects with the surrounding streaks of black and white or what purpose the effect serves.  I personally don''t mind a distorted effect on a face, but I''d like to still be able to find some meaning or expression on that face, and see how or why it is distorted by some effect. 3', '2002-12-30 00:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(179413, 10334, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful B&amp;W but oh how I long to see it in color.  The is the best close up of a bird that I''ve seen in a long time.  I hope you caught this in the wild and not in an avairy.  I mean the focus is right on.  Great shot.  A 9 and close to a 10 (if it had been in color).  PTL</td>', 'This is a beautiful B&W but oh how I long to see it in color.  The is the best close up of a bird that I''ve seen in a long time.  I hope you caught this in the wild and not in an avairy.  I mean the focus is right on.  Great shot.  A 9 and close to a 10 (if it had been in color).  PTL', '2002-12-30 00:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(179421, 10124, 4648, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen this guy before and he''s still georgeous.  I especially love how well you photographed his beak and feet.  The detail is awesome.  I can almost smell the bread he is eating, too.  This is a definite 10.  PTL</td>', 'I think I''ve seen this guy before and he''s still georgeous.  I especially love how well you photographed his beak and feet.  The detail is awesome.  I can almost smell the bread he is eating, too.  This is a definite 10.  PTL', '2002-12-30 00:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(179423, 10204, 4007, '<td valign="top">The background would be better off purely black, but without spot edits I understand that might not have been fully possible.</td>', 'The background would be better off purely black, but without spot edits I understand that might not have been fully possible.', '2002-12-30 00:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(179429, 10285, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t roll over and squash them.  Let''s see - a chihuahua and a miniture snauzer.  Am I right?  Neither one is very big.  I just wish I could see them better.  Oh, it''s a picture of YOU?  The title is "Nap Time With Dad" so they are the subject.  Sorry.  They do look comfortable.  Because there is more of you than them, I''d have to cut my score to a 7.  Sorry PTL</td>', 'Don''t roll over and squash them.  Let''s see - a chihuahua and a miniture snauzer.  Am I right?  Neither one is very big.  I just wish I could see them better.  Oh, it''s a picture of YOU?  The title is "Nap Time With Dad" so they are the subject.  Sorry.  They do look comfortable.  Because there is more of you than them, I''d have to cut my score to a 7.  Sorry PTL', '2002-12-30 00:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(179435, 10243, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.  So much mistic to it.  The eyes say espianoge and intrigue.  I love this.  Everything is right about it.  I''d definitely give it a 10.  PTL</td>', 'This is awesome.  So much mistic to it.  The eyes say espianoge and intrigue.  I love this.  Everything is right about it.  I''d definitely give it a 10.  PTL', '2002-12-30 00:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(179436, 10326, 92, '<td valign="top">I wish this photo came with a phone number:)</td>', 'I wish this photo came with a phone number:)', '2002-12-30 00:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(179442, 10329, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful studio portrait.  I love the soft focus.  The hat add to it so much.  This is a 10 in my book.  Great subject and great shot.  PTL</td>', 'Beautiful studio portrait.  I love the soft focus.  The hat add to it so much.  This is a 10 in my book.  Great subject and great shot.  PTL', '2002-12-30 00:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(179444, 10315, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ! Shiiizzzam</td>', 'Beautiful ! Shiiizzzam', '2002-12-30 00:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(179450, 10331, 2011, '<td valign="top">3 things:<br/>1: Wish the back of your head wasnt cropped off.<br/>2: Need a wee bit more light on your face and not so much shadow.<br/>3. Love the haircut.</td>', '3 things:1: Wish the back of your head wasnt cropped off.2: Need a wee bit more light on your face and not so much shadow.3. Love the haircut.', '2002-12-30 00:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(179453, 10226, 4648, '<td valign="top">The dog is a great photographer.  He has s a nice soft focus but he could have cropped out most of the left side looking at his photo.  He shouldn''t have cropped off the top of your head.  It is a portrait of you that he took.  Remind him you are the subject, not what''s on the table.  That''s what he wants.  But I''d still give him a 7 for his photo, possible an 8.  PTL</td>', 'The dog is a great photographer.  He has s a nice soft focus but he could have cropped out most of the left side looking at his photo.  He shouldn''t have cropped off the top of your head.  It is a portrait of you that he took.  Remind him you are the subject, not what''s on the table.  That''s what he wants.  But I''d still give him a 7 for his photo, possible an 8.  PTL', '2002-12-30 00:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(179458, 10088, 4648, '<td valign="top">I can see it now. You are gonna get hit big time because this is not B&amp;W.  They were discussing this in a forum.  But it still is a beautiful portrait of a beautiful dog.  And he is keeping his eye on you.  Just in case you decide to go outside, he''s not going to be left behind.  Great shot.  Technically I would have to cut the score because it''s technically not B&amp;W.  But it still would be an 8. 2 is enough to cut for that.  PTL</td>', 'I can see it now. You are gonna get hit big time because this is not B&W.  They were discussing this in a forum.  But it still is a beautiful portrait of a beautiful dog.  And he is keeping his eye on you.  Just in case you decide to go outside, he''s not going to be left behind.  Great shot.  Technically I would have to cut the score because it''s technically not B&W.  But it still would be an 8. 2 is enough to cut for that.  PTL', '2002-12-30 00:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(179460, 10224, 4648, '<td valign="top">One georgeous white cat.  Looks like his fur is so soft.   Green eyes?  Attractive lady holding the cat also.  I wasn''t ignoring her.  It''s just that the cat, being so white, catches you eye.  I love the flower pot behind them.  Watch someone tell you to remove it.  To me it keeps this from being just a shot or photo and makes it a special shot and portrait.  Good job.  Nice portrait.  That would be an 8 from me.  PTL</td>', 'One georgeous white cat.  Looks like his fur is so soft.   Green eyes?  Attractive lady holding the cat also.  I wasn''t ignoring her.  It''s just that the cat, being so white, catches you eye.  I love the flower pot behind them.  Watch someone tell you to remove it.  To me it keeps this from being just a shot or photo and makes it a special shot and portrait.  Good job.  Nice portrait.  That would be an 8 from me.  PTL', '2002-12-30 01:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(179461, 10227, 2011, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like this, but I wish you wouldnt have cropped off the tip of her nose.</td>', 'I REALLY like this, but I wish you wouldnt have cropped off the tip of her nose.', '2002-12-30 01:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(179465, 10226, 2011, '<td valign="top">Twisted............</td>', 'Twisted............', '2002-12-30 01:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(179476, 10319, 2011, '<td valign="top">I like this. Think I would have cropped the black line out of the left side though. And a small fill light would have filled out the right side of your face some.</td>', 'I like this. Think I would have cropped the black line out of the left side though. And a small fill light would have filled out the right side of your face some.', '2002-12-30 01:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(179478, 10183, 4615, '<td valign="top">lots of emotion conveyed.</td>', 'lots of emotion conveyed.', '2002-12-30 01:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(179480, 10267, 4615, '<td valign="top">Gilligan''s island hat.</td>', 'Gilligan''s island hat.', '2002-12-30 01:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(179493, 10333, 772, '<td valign="top">I think you have done a great job of capturing your subject in this photo.  The pose is fine and the composition is excellent.  I think this image may be lacking some of the important qualities of black and white images in general.  The tonal range in this image is fairly flat.  There is not much on the high level end of the histogram probably.  This image has a casual mood, but the background setting could be considered somewhat distracting with the stronger contrasts that are visible there.  The grain works well, but I think that a little extra sharpness would be good as well.  Possibly some more light would bring out the detail in the dark shirt also... - setzler</td>', 'I think you have done a great job of capturing your subject in this photo.  The pose is fine and the composition is excellent.  I think this image may be lacking some of the important qualities of black and white images in general.  The tonal range in this image is fairly flat.  There is not much on the high level end of the histogram probably.  This image has a casual mood, but the background setting could be considered somewhat distracting with the stronger contrasts that are visible there.  The grain works well, but I think that a little extra sharpness would be good as well.  Possibly some more light would bring out the detail in the dark shirt also... - setzler', '2002-12-30 01:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(179502, 10216, 259, '<td valign="top">i don''t know if its just my monitor or what, but i think it seems lighter than when you showed me before.</td>', 'i don''t know if its just my monitor or what, but i think it seems lighter than when you showed me before.', '2002-12-30 01:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(179507, 10129, 5826, '<td valign="top">Josh is cool.  I like josh.  I want to be josh''s friend.</td>', 'Josh is cool.  I like josh.  I want to be josh''s friend.', '2002-12-30 02:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(179508, 10285, 1863, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but I think this picture is completely adorable. I wish I was that man sleeping, and the doggies were mine :)<br/>-Annida</td>', 'I don''t know why, but I think this picture is completely adorable. I wish I was that man sleeping, and the doggies were mine :)-Annida', '2002-12-30 02:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(179534, 10216, 4007, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems too harsh here.  A tighter crop might be a good idea as well. 4</td>', 'The lighting seems too harsh here.  A tighter crop might be a good idea as well. 4', '2002-12-30 03:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(179536, 10185, 5892, '<td valign="top">I like the detail of the close up, but I almost feel as though you have lost your subject</td>', 'I like the detail of the close up, but I almost feel as though you have lost your subject', '2002-12-30 03:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(179551, 10281, 3032, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened look distracts. Otherwise it would be a good photo.</td>', 'Oversharpened look distracts. Otherwise it would be a good photo.', '2002-12-30 04:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(179556, 10243, 3032, '<td valign="top">Even without color this picture has a very strong impact and the lighting looks more balanced (the red in the original I have seen was so strong that it blew away the texture at the bottom-middle to the bottom right and right of the right eye).<br/>Awesome photo!</td>', 'Even without color this picture has a very strong impact and the lighting looks more balanced (the red in the original I have seen was so strong that it blew away the texture at the bottom-middle to the bottom right and right of the right eye).Awesome photo!', '2002-12-30 04:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(179557, 10127, 3032, '<td valign="top">Watch the compression level! Jpeg artifacts ruined the detail around the left eye abd in the hair. :-(</td>', 'Watch the compression level! Jpeg artifacts ruined the detail around the left eye abd in the hair. :-(', '2002-12-30 04:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(179559, 10243, 255, '<td valign="top">Leslie? :)</td>', 'Leslie? :)', '2002-12-30 04:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(179571, 10106, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective shot.  Obviously the b&amp;w here works well.  I like how you have chosen the whole face and put the lighting to terrific use.  The hood adds interest as well.  Great composition and clarity.  Well done 10</td>', 'Excellent perspective shot.  Obviously the b&w here works well.  I like how you have chosen the whole face and put the lighting to terrific use.  The hood adds interest as well.  Great composition and clarity.  Well done 10', '2002-12-30 05:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(179572, 10166, 1829, '<td valign="top">Wow would you just look at that Moustache.  Looks like a man from the 20''s.  Excellent shot.  Great capture.</td>', 'Wow would you just look at that Moustache.  Looks like a man from the 20''s.  Excellent shot.  Great capture.', '2002-12-30 06:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(179574, 10112, 1829, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait shot.  The composition is excellent.  You chose a great place to photograph her.  I really like her hat with her hair pulled back off her face.  Well done.</td>', 'Lovely portrait shot.  The composition is excellent.  You chose a great place to photograph her.  I really like her hat with her hair pulled back off her face.  Well done.', '2002-12-30 06:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(179575, 10213, 1829, '<td valign="top">A beautiful natural looking girl.  I like how she is not looking straight at the camera.  Fantastic composition and smile.  Well done.</td>', 'A beautiful natural looking girl.  I like how she is not looking straight at the camera.  Fantastic composition and smile.  Well done.', '2002-12-30 06:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(179576, 10281, 1829, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait.  I love her expression on her face.  I like the hat as well.  Great shot.</td>', 'Lovely portrait.  I love her expression on her face.  I like the hat as well.  Great shot.', '2002-12-30 06:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(179578, 10130, 1829, '<td valign="top">Great expressive portrait photo.  I like how he has his head turned towards the light to hightlight his face.  Brilliant work.</td>', 'Great expressive portrait photo.  I like how he has his head turned towards the light to hightlight his face.  Brilliant work.', '2002-12-30 06:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(179579, 10187, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  The hat adds interest with his head slightly tilted downwards.  His white shirt against the black background is a good contrast.</td>', 'Excellent composition.  The hat adds interest with his head slightly tilted downwards.  His white shirt against the black background is a good contrast.', '2002-12-30 06:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(179580, 10315, 1829, '<td valign="top">Now this is what I call an awesome macro shot.  Very expressive for a cat.  Clarity and composition is fabulous.  Well done. 10</td>', 'Now this is what I call an awesome macro shot.  Very expressive for a cat.  Clarity and composition is fabulous.  Well done. 10', '2002-12-30 06:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(179581, 10118, 1829, '<td valign="top">Great composition and clarity.  I love her hat as well.  The backdrop is a little wrinkly, but I think it adds to the effect.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great composition and clarity.  I love her hat as well.  The backdrop is a little wrinkly, but I think it adds to the effect.  Nicely done.', '2002-12-30 06:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
