(180033, 10107, 327, '<td valign="top">LoL....fun shot, with very nice.....very, very nice focus, and tones. The light here is super. Well done. Tell that kid to keep it up! He''s going places!! &lt;g&gt;</td>', 'LoL....fun shot, with very nice.....very, very nice focus, and tones. The light here is super. Well done. Tell that kid to keep it up! He''s going places!! <g>', '2002-12-30 18:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
