(180052, 10218, 1202, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great helper and model.   The double bright spots in his eyes fro the flash? are quite distracting to me.   Also it looks like the focus is not as sharp as it should be for a shot of this type.   He is an action figure and the soft focus takes away from that feel.   Good job though.</td>', 'Looks like a great helper and model.   The double bright spots in his eyes fro the flash? are quite distracting to me.   Also it looks like the focus is not as sharp as it should be for a shot of this type.   He is an action figure and the soft focus takes away from that feel.   Good job though.', '2002-12-30 19:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(180055, 10106, 1202, '<td valign="top">this is a very good capture with a lot of detail.  Good sharp focus.   what I don''t like is all of those sharpies in his eyes.   They don''t help at all, othewise great.</td>', 'this is a very good capture with a lot of detail.  Good sharp focus.   what I don''t like is all of those sharpies in his eyes.   They don''t help at all, othewise great.', '2002-12-30 19:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(180057, 10243, 4585, '<td valign="top">Absolutely messmerizing (sp)...perfect tones and contrasts...This is a 10 for me.</td>', 'Absolutely messmerizing (sp)...perfect tones and contrasts...This is a 10 for me.', '2002-12-30 19:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(180058, 10300, 4411, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot. The subject stands out from the background nicely, a good job ''losing'' what could have been a major distraction. The light on the girder even gives a nice strong line to the back of her head. Excellent work, well done.</td>', 'A lovely shot. The subject stands out from the background nicely, a good job ''losing'' what could have been a major distraction. The light on the girder even gives a nice strong line to the back of her head. Excellent work, well done.', '2002-12-30 19:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(180060, 10263, 4585, '<td valign="top">IMHO...the shadow casted upon the subject''s right side and particularly the eye is a bit distracting.  Otherwise good shot, nice frame fill and very cute subject.  Good luck!</td>', 'IMHO...the shadow casted upon the subject''s right side and particularly the eye is a bit distracting.  Otherwise good shot, nice frame fill and very cute subject.  Good luck!', '2002-12-30 19:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(180062, 10310, 4585, '<td valign="top">Excellent effect.  A bit bright on the chin.  Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent effect.  A bit bright on the chin.  Good luck.', '2002-12-30 19:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(180064, 10239, 4585, '<td valign="top">If by design the image looks a little soft on focus on the visible side of the face.  Love the efect though.  Good luck.</td>', 'If by design the image looks a little soft on focus on the visible side of the face.  Love the efect though.  Good luck.', '2002-12-30 19:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(180065, 10156, 1202, '<td valign="top">You are luck to have such a good model.   I am not sure why but his face looks grainier than it should based upon the background.   It mat be a little overprocessed, it shows in his teeth also.   I do fell that a lot of us get too close to the monitor and don''t get back to look, so we just pick them apart from about three inches.   I backed away and have the same thoughts, good picture with its faults.</td>', 'You are luck to have such a good model.   I am not sure why but his face looks grainier than it should based upon the background.   It mat be a little overprocessed, it shows in his teeth also.   I do fell that a lot of us get too close to the monitor and don''t get back to look, so we just pick them apart from about three inches.   I backed away and have the same thoughts, good picture with its faults.', '2002-12-30 19:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(180066, 10213, 4585, '<td valign="top">Stunning subject.  Excellent tonality.  I would have cropped it a bit tighter.  Good luck!</td>', 'Stunning subject.  Excellent tonality.  I would have cropped it a bit tighter.  Good luck!', '2002-12-30 19:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(180068, 10119, 4585, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Perfectly lit.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well done.  Perfectly lit.  Good luck.', '2002-12-30 19:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
