(180080, 10305, 4585, '<td valign="top">So well done I simply have nothing further to add.  I read about this technique (high key).  Your image is textbook perfect.   Good luck....8</td>', 'So well done I simply have nothing further to add.  I read about this technique (high key).  Your image is textbook perfect.   Good luck....8', '2002-12-30 19:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
