(180088, 10112, 4585, '<td valign="top">I am not convinced that this was the best angle or POV for this image.  You have subject with stunning eyes!  Why not a tighter image and have her either look up at the camera lens or look down at it?  Good luck!</td>', 'I am not convinced that this was the best angle or POV for this image.  You have subject with stunning eyes!  Why not a tighter image and have her either look up at the camera lens or look down at it?  Good luck!', '2002-12-30 19:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
