(180219, 10183, 327, '<td valign="top">I want to see you smile. Not a bad self portrait. Good luck in the challenge. Lisae, Lisae, Lisae.</td>', 'I want to see you smile. Not a bad self portrait. Good luck in the challenge. Lisae, Lisae, Lisae.', '2002-12-30 22:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(180225, 10221, 1280, '<td valign="top">Everything is wonderful in this portrait except for the position of her hand.  I don''t care for that...distracting.  The hand competes with her face, being close in size and color, and almost appears to be coming out of nowhere since her arm blends in with her shirt.<br/>Focus, and tone, and expression are all good though.</td>', 'Everything is wonderful in this portrait except for the position of her hand.  I don''t care for that...distracting.  The hand competes with her face, being close in size and color, and almost appears to be coming out of nowhere since her arm blends in with her shirt.Focus, and tone, and expression are all good though.', '2002-12-30 23:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(180228, 10273, 1280, '<td valign="top">Can''t imagine why you cropped the child''s smile away. Lots of potential here.</td>', 'Can''t imagine why you cropped the child''s smile away. Lots of potential here.', '2002-12-30 23:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(180244, 10213, 5908, '<td valign="top">The most beautiful girl I''ve ever seen!!!!!!</td>', 'The most beautiful girl I''ve ever seen!!!!!!', '2002-12-30 23:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(180247, 10315, 3936, '<td valign="top">What a great shot!  Good lighting, depth of field, and exposure control.  And especially those eyes.  10!</td>', 'What a great shot!  Good lighting, depth of field, and exposure control.  And especially those eyes.  10!', '2002-12-31 00:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(180267, 10269, 3936, '<td valign="top">9 for a great shot, but should be -10 if it turns out you made this angel cry just to get a picture.</td>', '9 for a great shot, but should be -10 if it turns out you made this angel cry just to get a picture.', '2002-12-31 00:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(180269, 10124, 3936, '<td valign="top">Good job of keeping all the detail in a difficult subject.  Just a couple of small washed out areas on top of the head.  Great detail on the beak and the bread.  8</td>', 'Good job of keeping all the detail in a difficult subject.  Just a couple of small washed out areas on top of the head.  Great detail on the beak and the bread.  8', '2002-12-31 01:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(180270, 10150, 2337, '<td valign="top">This is very nice, but I think you should have resized so that one side was the full 640 pixels... This was too small to show the detail.</td>', 'This is very nice, but I think you should have resized so that one side was the full 640 pixels... This was too small to show the detail.', '2002-12-31 01:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(180280, 10281, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is a brilliant composition. The hat is a nice touch, the crop shows all that is important. The body language and expression is difficult to capture in a child, but you mastered it in this shot. This is great work.  I like the clean background without distractions -  I do often times like a soft focus when used in a portrait shot, My personal preference is to keep the eyes in clear focus at all times. Youre eyes look just a little soft here for my taste and the flash is showing just a bit harsh reflecting in them.  This is one of my 10s this week, Congrats on a great shot - Gotcha</td>', 'This is a brilliant composition. The hat is a nice touch, the crop shows all that is important. The body language and expression is difficult to capture in a child, but you mastered it in this shot. This is great work.  I like the clean background without distractions -  I do often times like a soft focus when used in a portrait shot, My personal preference is to keep the eyes in clear focus at all times. Youre eyes look just a little soft here for my taste and the flash is showing just a bit harsh reflecting in them.  This is one of my 10s this week, Congrats on a great shot - Gotcha', '2002-12-31 01:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(180302, 10331, 5684, '<td valign="top">jack osbourne</td>', 'jack osbourne', '2002-12-31 01:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(180304, 10106, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, I like everything about it. It''s hard to offer a suggestion on a perfect shot - Congrats - 10 Gotcha</td>', 'This is a great shot, I like everything about it. It''s hard to offer a suggestion on a perfect shot - Congrats - 10 Gotcha', '2002-12-31 02:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(180316, 10224, 1829, '<td valign="top">Lovely clear image.  I assume Roscoe is the cat and what a cat he/she is.  Just big and beautiful.  An excellent shot portraying the love from the owner.  Very well done.</td>', 'Lovely clear image.  I assume Roscoe is the cat and what a cat he/she is.  Just big and beautiful.  An excellent shot portraying the love from the owner.  Very well done.', '2002-12-31 03:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(180324, 10267, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the part about the hat means, but I like the shot.  I like the lighting, and the composition is effective, though there is almost TOO much negative space for me.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the part about the hat means, but I like the shot.  I like the lighting, and the composition is effective, though there is almost TOO much negative space for me.', '2002-12-31 04:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(180325, 10252, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the technical reason for the "graininess" is, but oddly enough, I like the effect, and find the photo to be interesting to look at.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the technical reason for the "graininess" is, but oddly enough, I like the effect, and find the photo to be interesting to look at.', '2002-12-31 05:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(180326, 10323, 2553, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot with nice tonal range.</td>', 'Interesting shot with nice tonal range.', '2002-12-31 05:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(180327, 10156, 2553, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot!  Love the lighting,  and your composition.  All works well together for an adorable portrait.</td>', 'Terrific shot!  Love the lighting,  and your composition.  All works well together for an adorable portrait.', '2002-12-31 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(180328, 10326, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  He makes me think of Val Kilmer.  I like the nice tight composition around his body.  One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'Love this shot.  He makes me think of Val Kilmer.  I like the nice tight composition around his body.  One of my favorites this week.', '2002-12-31 05:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(180329, 10227, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very interesting "art type" portrait, that does manage to capture some expressiveness.  The composition feels a little unbalanced to me, with just a little too much negative space for my taste.  Overall though, I like the photo.</td>', 'Very interesting "art type" portrait, that does manage to capture some expressiveness.  The composition feels a little unbalanced to me, with just a little too much negative space for my taste.  Overall though, I like the photo.', '2002-12-31 05:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(180330, 10300, 2553, '<td valign="top">For me, the background competes for attention with the girl.  My eyes are continually drawn away from her face to all of the bright areas in the background.</td>', 'For me, the background competes for attention with the girl.  My eyes are continually drawn away from her face to all of the bright areas in the background.', '2002-12-31 05:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(180331, 10153, 2553, '<td valign="top">What a darling shot.  I love the nice tight composition, and the expressions on their faces.</td>', 'What a darling shot.  I love the nice tight composition, and the expressions on their faces.', '2002-12-31 05:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(180332, 10231, 2553, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen more light on her face to really make it stand out more from the background, and draw the eyes to it.  I find that the lights are attracting my eyes away from her face.</td>', 'I would like to have seen more light on her face to really make it stand out more from the background, and draw the eyes to it.  I find that the lights are attracting my eyes away from her face.', '2002-12-31 05:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(180333, 10263, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the way she is "posed", and the nice tight composition.  I would like to see more light on her whole face, especially on the right - on my monitor, the shadows around her eye make it almost look like she has a black eye!</td>', 'I love the way she is "posed", and the nice tight composition.  I would like to see more light on her whole face, especially on the right - on my monitor, the shadows around her eye make it almost look like she has a black eye!', '2002-12-31 05:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(180334, 10146, 2553, '<td valign="top">The man doesn''t look as comfortable having the photo taken as the woman does!  I like the composition of this shot, especially that you weren''t afraid to get in close.  The tight composition works well.</td>', 'The man doesn''t look as comfortable having the photo taken as the woman does!  I like the composition of this shot, especially that you weren''t afraid to get in close.  The tight composition works well.', '2002-12-31 05:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(180335, 10281, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  She is so adorable.  Your lighting, and the composition work really well for me, and her "pose" is wonderful.  Would love to know what kind of lighting setup you have.</td>', 'I love this shot!  She is so adorable.  Your lighting, and the composition work really well for me, and her "pose" is wonderful.  Would love to know what kind of lighting setup you have.', '2002-12-31 05:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(180336, 10115, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting on this, with the cast shadows of hair on skin.  I like that the hair disappears into the background, and I like the very comtemplative expression.</td>', 'I really like the lighting on this, with the cast shadows of hair on skin.  I like that the hair disappears into the background, and I like the very comtemplative expression.', '2002-12-31 05:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(180337, 10305, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  A somewhat "arty" feel to it, but you haven''t lost all of the definition of her features, and you''ve maintained the expressiveness of her eyes.  I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very nice!  A somewhat "arty" feel to it, but you haven''t lost all of the definition of her features, and you''ve maintained the expressiveness of her eyes.  I like it a lot.', '2002-12-31 05:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(180338, 10203, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this shot because it seems natural - it looks like he just stopped work for a moment and was looking at you over the top of a car.  It seems to capture his personality.<br/></td>', 'I like this shot because it seems natural - it looks like he just stopped work for a moment and was looking at you over the top of a car.  It seems to capture his personality.', '2002-12-31 05:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(180339, 10243, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  The tight composition is wonderful.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  The tight composition is wonderful.', '2002-12-31 05:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(180340, 10315, 2553, '<td valign="top">A terrific close up shot!  I love the composition.</td>', 'A terrific close up shot!  I love the composition.', '2002-12-31 05:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(180341, 10106, 2553, '<td valign="top">Even with the hood, you managed to have great lighting on the face. I love the composition, and that the face is surrounded by the darkness created by the hood.</td>', 'Even with the hood, you managed to have great lighting on the face. I love the composition, and that the face is surrounded by the darkness created by the hood.', '2002-12-31 05:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(180342, 10269, 2553, '<td valign="top">Lighting and composition work well for me, and I like that you captured her expression so well.</td>', 'Lighting and composition work well for me, and I like that you captured her expression so well.', '2002-12-31 05:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(180344, 10275, 2553, '<td valign="top">Too much negative space for my taste, but I do like the simplicity of the shot, and the way the man is composed in the shot.</td>', 'Too much negative space for my taste, but I do like the simplicity of the shot, and the way the man is composed in the shot.', '2002-12-31 05:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(180345, 10198, 2553, '<td valign="top">Your capture of her face is great, but the background really competes for attention.  I think maybe if the background was defocused that it would really make her lovely face stand out.</td>', 'Your capture of her face is great, but the background really competes for attention.  I think maybe if the background was defocused that it would really make her lovely face stand out.', '2002-12-31 05:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(180346, 10119, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good, clear, simple and straightforward - I like this shot, but personally would have cropped a little more from the left side.</td>', 'Good, clear, simple and straightforward - I like this shot, but personally would have cropped a little more from the left side.', '2002-12-31 05:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(180347, 10179, 2553, '<td valign="top">Poor thing, I feel for her!  Good lighting and I like the nice tight crop.</td>', 'Poor thing, I feel for her!  Good lighting and I like the nice tight crop.', '2002-12-31 05:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(180348, 10331, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the do!  I like the composition, but am not sure that I like the lighting.</td>', 'Love the do!  I like the composition, but am not sure that I like the lighting.', '2002-12-31 05:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(180349, 10088, 2553, '<td valign="top">Overall, a little dark for my taste.  I would like to have seen more tonal range.  I would also have like to have seen a tighter crop on the dog''s face, removing most of the rug that is drawing my eyes from his adorable face.</td>', 'Overall, a little dark for my taste.  I would like to have seen more tonal range.  I would also have like to have seen a tighter crop on the dog''s face, removing most of the rug that is drawing my eyes from his adorable face.', '2002-12-31 05:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(180350, 10303, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, and a nice clear shot, capturing the expressiveness of his face.</td>', 'Good lighting, and a nice clear shot, capturing the expressiveness of his face.', '2002-12-31 05:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(180351, 10117, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, though I think I would like to have seen a little more light on her face.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, though I think I would like to have seen a little more light on her face.', '2002-12-31 05:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(180352, 10223, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition and use of light/dark.  Her expression takes away from the shot for me though-she looks completely bored.</td>', 'I really like your composition and use of light/dark.  Her expression takes away from the shot for me though-she looks completely bored.', '2002-12-31 05:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(180353, 10144, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in this shot, and the composition is effective for me.</td>', 'I like the lighting in this shot, and the composition is effective for me.', '2002-12-31 05:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(180355, 10307, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  I like the composition, and the lighting, and her ruffley little dress, but her expression seems to say that she is not all that happy right now!</td>', 'I like this shot.  I like the composition, and the lighting, and her ruffley little dress, but her expression seems to say that she is not all that happy right now!', '2002-12-31 05:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(180356, 10133, 2553, '<td valign="top">This shot feels unbalanced to me.  I really want to see just a bit more light on the right side of his face. I like the lighting that makes the clean sharp edge of his face on the left, and I like that the other side fades into the blackness, but I really feel like I need to see just the hint of his features on the right.</td>', 'This shot feels unbalanced to me.  I really want to see just a bit more light on the right side of his face. I like the lighting that makes the clean sharp edge of his face on the left, and I like that the other side fades into the blackness, but I really feel like I need to see just the hint of his features on the right.', '2002-12-31 05:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(180364, 10245, 2130, '<td valign="top">nokkuð góð:)</td>', 'nokkuð góð:)', '2002-12-31 07:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(180365, 10189, 3032, '<td valign="top">The hand is a bit dominant in the image. Now that I look at it again that comment was cause by the fact that the image didn''t fit on the screen I was looking with at the time....<br/>I like this portrait, it has enough elements to tell a story about the person and it is done pretty good.</td>', 'The hand is a bit dominant in the image. Now that I look at it again that comment was cause by the fact that the image didn''t fit on the screen I was looking with at the time....I like this portrait, it has enough elements to tell a story about the person and it is done pretty good.', '2002-12-31 07:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(180366, 10187, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of this image. <br/>The attributes tell the background of the person, very good.<br/>Good exposure.<br/>One negative remark: The photographer is visible at the end of the trumpet, a minor flaw. Don''t know how to get that out, but something to watch out for in the future.</td>', 'I like the contrast of this image. The attributes tell the background of the person, very good.Good exposure.One negative remark: The photographer is visible at the end of the trumpet, a minor flaw. Don''t know how to get that out, but something to watch out for in the future.', '2002-12-31 07:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(180368, 10112, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good exposure. The images looks like it is softened somewhat, nice result. The gloves cover the skin of the hands, rendering it as neutral as the sweater, therefore all focus is on the face (good in my opinion) the hat does the same whit the hair. Love the eyes.</td>', 'Nice composition, good exposure. The images looks like it is softened somewhat, nice result. The gloves cover the skin of the hands, rendering it as neutral as the sweater, therefore all focus is on the face (good in my opinion) the hat does the same whit the hair. Love the eyes.', '2002-12-31 07:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(180370, 10173, 3032, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what the Alamo is, but it is a nice picture.<br/>Good use of aperture, good focus. Perhaps a bit underexposed or is that the nature of the light there?<br/>Nice smiles.</td>', 'I don''t know what the Alamo is, but it is a nice picture.Good use of aperture, good focus. Perhaps a bit underexposed or is that the nature of the light there?Nice smiles.', '2002-12-31 08:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(180381, 10322, 2780, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice photo. I would have preferred to see it at a different angle however, so more of the face is visible. Also, the fact that the crop is halfway through the keys is a little niggling but nothing major.</td>', 'It''s a very nice photo. I would have preferred to see it at a different angle however, so more of the face is visible. Also, the fact that the crop is halfway through the keys is a little niggling but nothing major.', '2002-12-31 08:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(180386, 10173, 4615, '<td valign="top">Very rich contrast between these two women.</td>', 'Very rich contrast between these two women.', '2002-12-31 08:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(180387, 10123, 4615, '<td valign="top">Looks like michael jackson after his nose falls off.  Seriously, this is a great image, a little disturbing and eerie.9</td>', 'Looks like michael jackson after his nose falls off.  Seriously, this is a great image, a little disturbing and eerie.9', '2002-12-31 08:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
