(180398, 10270, 1280, '<td valign="top">Omigosh...what a beautiful face!  Nicely done.</td>', 'Omigosh...what a beautiful face!  Nicely done.', '2002-12-31 09:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(180400, 10243, 4411, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen the colour version of this (I''m *devious* like that ;) ) which is absolutely breathtaking. Would be an 11 if you could have entered it.<br/>I don''t think B&amp;W does this any favours, but those eyes are still stunning, and the lighting, focus &amp; detail are all spot on. The scarf frames the eyes beautifuly and adds to the composition.<br/>Awesome work, but please show everyone the colour version after the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve seen the colour version of this (I''m *devious* like that ;) ) which is absolutely breathtaking. Would be an 11 if you could have entered it.I don''t think B&W does this any favours, but those eyes are still stunning, and the lighting, focus & detail are all spot on. The scarf frames the eyes beautifuly and adds to the composition.Awesome work, but please show everyone the colour version after the challenge.', '2002-12-31 10:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(180402, 10304, 4411, '<td valign="top">A lovely soft image with great composition capturing a bit of character. Excellent.</td>', 'A lovely soft image with great composition capturing a bit of character. Excellent.', '2002-12-31 10:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(180403, 10193, 2634, '<td valign="top">there are a couple of things you could improve with this photo. You should never place someone directly under something so that it looks like it is coming out of her head.  Also it looks like you might have resized this. It looks stretched in the width. It is a little to grainy(noisy). Other than that the portrait is nice with a nice shine in the eyes of the models.</td>', 'there are a couple of things you could improve with this photo. You should never place someone directly under something so that it looks like it is coming out of her head.  Also it looks like you might have resized this. It looks stretched in the width. It is a little to grainy(noisy). Other than that the portrait is nice with a nice shine in the eyes of the models.', '2002-12-31 10:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(180404, 10296, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The shadows are a bit harsh - maybe a bit of light bounced back into the frame would have helped? Composition is excellent. Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot. The shadows are a bit harsh - maybe a bit of light bounced back into the frame would have helped? Composition is excellent. Well done.', '2002-12-31 10:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(180405, 10270, 2634, '<td valign="top">This cat is adorable. Nice wide eyes. Two things I would change. Item in the foreground is distracting. I would crop part of it out. It is blown out(light was too strong on it). Also I would leave a little wider crop on the pic and use a shorter DOF. These are just suggestions, just my little opinion.</td>', 'This cat is adorable. Nice wide eyes. Two things I would change. Item in the foreground is distracting. I would crop part of it out. It is blown out(light was too strong on it). Also I would leave a little wider crop on the pic and use a shorter DOF. These are just suggestions, just my little opinion.', '2002-12-31 10:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(180407, 10186, 4411, '<td valign="top">Oh dear! I hope you''re not getting slaughtered for your choice of subject.<br/>I really like the composition on this, enough to persuade me that it does meet the challenge. The background seems quite noisy, but otherwise this is a very good shot. Well done &amp; good luck (I think you may need it!).</td>', 'Oh dear! I hope you''re not getting slaughtered for your choice of subject.I really like the composition on this, enough to persuade me that it does meet the challenge. The background seems quite noisy, but otherwise this is a very good shot. Well done & good luck (I think you may need it!).', '2002-12-31 10:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(180408, 10213, 2634, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait. I like the DOF, and the soft light on the face. The focus is great the contrast also great. The only little thing I would like to see is the rest of her hair on the right.<br/>Would also like to see the same shot with her looking at the camera.</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait. I like the DOF, and the soft light on the face. The focus is great the contrast also great. The only little thing I would like to see is the rest of her hair on the right.Would also like to see the same shot with her looking at the camera.', '2002-12-31 10:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(180409, 10273, 4411, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that the kid''s mouth is out of frame. For me it spoils an otherwise excellent shot.<br/>The idea is very good, as is the use of DoF. Lighting is also very well done.</td>', 'I don''t like that the kid''s mouth is out of frame. For me it spoils an otherwise excellent shot.The idea is very good, as is the use of DoF. Lighting is also very well done.', '2002-12-31 10:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(180410, 10231, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice profile portrait. I would like a little more light on her cute face and hair, and the light circles are a touch distracting.</td>', 'Nice profile portrait. I would like a little more light on her cute face and hair, and the light circles are a touch distracting.', '2002-12-31 10:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(180412, 10269, 4510, '<td valign="top">Great shot, best of luck for the challenge.</td>', 'Great shot, best of luck for the challenge.', '2002-12-31 10:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(180413, 10127, 2634, '<td valign="top">I like how you got in close to the subject. Your focus is a little more on the shirt than the face. His position doesn''t look relaxed. I would also like a drop more contrast.</td>', 'I like how you got in close to the subject. Your focus is a little more on the shirt than the face. His position doesn''t look relaxed. I would also like a drop more contrast.', '2002-12-31 10:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(180414, 10133, 4510, '<td valign="top">Good dramatic lighting, great shot.</td>', 'Good dramatic lighting, great shot.', '2002-12-31 10:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(180415, 10223, 3724, '<td valign="top">i scored this high........  i enjoy the mood presented....... the back in black is good for this shot,  it isolates and frames - as it should.  The facial expression, has typical blase'' features for a young girl, which are always interesting and captured so well here.  The shimmer on her eyes, though a minimal part of the image, draw me in......      I think this is a super shot.  <br/></td>', 'i scored this high........  i enjoy the mood presented....... the back in black is good for this shot,  it isolates and frames - as it should.  The facial expression, has typical blase'' features for a young girl, which are always interesting and captured so well here.  The shimmer on her eyes, though a minimal part of the image, draw me in......      I think this is a super shot.  ', '2002-12-31 10:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(180416, 10146, 4510, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I personally would  have prefered the whole of the gentlemans head to be included.</td>', 'Good shot, I personally would  have prefered the whole of the gentlemans head to be included.', '2002-12-31 10:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(180417, 10106, 3724, '<td valign="top">I scored this 9........   I like the framing of the hood....it is a beautiful and interesting young face - a very good subject.    Your b&amp;w tonality is superb.</td>', 'I scored this 9........   I like the framing of the hood....it is a beautiful and interesting young face - a very good subject.    Your b&w tonality is superb.', '2002-12-31 10:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(180418, 10213, 4510, '<td valign="top">Beautiful outdoor portrait, great use of DOF, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful outdoor portrait, great use of DOF, good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-31 10:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(180419, 10156, 3724, '<td valign="top">A beautiful expression on this face.........   i love the shock of white/blonde hair and the overall contrast and tone is good,  which makes this a special pic........</td>', 'A beautiful expression on this face.........   i love the shock of white/blonde hair and the overall contrast and tone is good,  which makes this a special pic........', '2002-12-31 10:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(180420, 10153, 1280, '<td valign="top">Sweet. Good focus on the beautiful eyes.</td>', 'Sweet. Good focus on the beautiful eyes.', '2002-12-31 10:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(180421, 10198, 1280, '<td valign="top">Lovely work!</td>', 'Lovely work!', '2002-12-31 10:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(180426, 10285, 4510, '<td valign="top">Great shot, what breed of dog are they?</td>', 'Great shot, what breed of dog are they?', '2002-12-31 10:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(180427, 10269, 3724, '<td valign="top">a priceless moment..........   this face is incredible, but the soft focus hand is not necessary, and if left out and cropped, would make this a stronger image.</td>', 'a priceless moment..........   this face is incredible, but the soft focus hand is not necessary, and if left out and cropped, would make this a stronger image.', '2002-12-31 10:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(180430, 10281, 3724, '<td valign="top">cool pic........   i like everything about it, except the processing/sharpening</td>', 'cool pic........   i like everything about it, except the processing/sharpening', '2002-12-31 11:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(180435, 10315, 3724, '<td valign="top">this kitty has nine..............</td>', 'this kitty has nine..............', '2002-12-31 11:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
