(180630, 10304, 472, '<td valign="top">super cute. wish it wasnt blurry. the composition is top notch as is the light and shadow. i like the low contrast effect.</td>', 'super cute. wish it wasnt blurry. the composition is top notch as is the light and shadow. i like the low contrast effect.', '2002-12-31 23:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(180631, 10136, 3900, '<td valign="top">Dying to know how you pulled this off..., but anyway, one of my favs for this challenge.  At first I wasn''t sure what to make of it, but I kept coming back to it and it kept growing on me ... one of the few original and interesting shots.</td>', 'Dying to know how you pulled this off..., but anyway, one of my favs for this challenge.  At first I wasn''t sure what to make of it, but I kept coming back to it and it kept growing on me ... one of the few original and interesting shots.', '2002-12-31 23:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
