(180646, 10270, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good capture - especially if this is a kitten!  Really like the composition and the lighting.  I like the yarn in the foreground - for me it adds interest to the shot without detracting from the subject.</td>', 'Good capture - especially if this is a kitten!  Really like the composition and the lighting.  I like the yarn in the foreground - for me it adds interest to the shot without detracting from the subject.', '2003-01-01 00:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(180647, 10130, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  I think the lighting on his face is perfect.  I might have cropped out most of the stuff on the right side, but then again, it does kind of lend a sense of "place" to the shot.</td>', 'I like this shot.  I think the lighting on his face is perfect.  I might have cropped out most of the stuff on the right side, but then again, it does kind of lend a sense of "place" to the shot.', '2003-01-01 00:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
