(180649, 10136, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is much too abstract for me.  I do like some "art" shots, but this one is a little over the edge for me.  I can make out a man''s face, but the whole photo leaves me with more questions than answers.</td>', 'This is much too abstract for me.  I do like some "art" shots, but this one is a little over the edge for me.  I can make out a man''s face, but the whole photo leaves me with more questions than answers.', '2003-01-01 00:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
