(180652, 10124, 2553, '<td valign="top">I thought the beaks were kind of smooth - this one looks all scratched up or something.  I like the good clear detail of the feathers.</td>', 'I thought the beaks were kind of smooth - this one looks all scratched up or something.  I like the good clear detail of the feathers.', '2003-01-01 00:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(180661, 10226, 472, '<td valign="top">an interesting idea.  this time we have switched perspectives so it is the dog taking the portrait of the human. :)  photographically, it''s well done. the only place it could use some work is in the levels adjustment to increase the contrast of the shades</td>', 'an interesting idea.  this time we have switched perspectives so it is the dog taking the portrait of the human. :)  photographically, it''s well done. the only place it could use some work is in the levels adjustment to increase the contrast of the shades', '2003-01-01 03:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
