(180669, 10333, 472, '<td valign="top">this seems a very warm and affectionate portrayal of a warm and friendly person.  quite appealing, the light through the glasses.  there is a focus issue. also a bit of grain but the focus issue predominates.  some people probably also take exception with what''s in the bg right above her forehead :)</td>', 'this seems a very warm and affectionate portrayal of a warm and friendly person.  quite appealing, the light through the glasses.  there is a focus issue. also a bit of grain but the focus issue predominates.  some people probably also take exception with what''s in the bg right above her forehead :)', '2003-01-01 03:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
