(180692, 10309, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good use of light, I feel it was taken from a little too low.   Too much up the nostril for this close up crop,  but I am nit picking.   Nice shot.</td>', 'Good use of light, I feel it was taken from a little too low.   Too much up the nostril for this close up crop,  but I am nit picking.   Nice shot.', '2003-01-01 09:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(180693, 10107, 1202, '<td valign="top">Cute but it comes across as more of a snap shot than a portrait.   "Portrait" yells out to me that we are going to hang it on the wall where the visitors can see it, so a small degree of formality might be in order.   Just my opinion.</td>', 'Cute but it comes across as more of a snap shot than a portrait.   "Portrait" yells out to me that we are going to hang it on the wall where the visitors can see it, so a small degree of formality might be in order.   Just my opinion.', '2003-01-01 09:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
