(180696, 10300, 1202, '<td valign="top">I feel Tara didn''t need the bridge, she is a stand alone subject.   The light bridge structure in the background may give you the contrast you needed, but it does distract from her.</td>', 'I feel Tara didn''t need the bridge, she is a stand alone subject.   The light bridge structure in the background may give you the contrast you needed, but it does distract from her.', '2003-01-01 09:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
