(180701, 10127, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a little flat to me.   Maybe more light on your backdrop to make the subject stand out, as is it all blends together.   To be real picky (no pun intended) it looks as though there is something on his right nostril.  If you overlooked that then shame on you, nut if it is natural then okay.</td>', 'Nice shot but a little flat to me.   Maybe more light on your backdrop to make the subject stand out, as is it all blends together.   To be real picky (no pun intended) it looks as though there is something on his right nostril.  If you overlooked that then shame on you, nut if it is natural then okay.', '2003-01-01 10:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
