(180806, 10270, 4007, '<td valign="top">It''d be better off without the fluffy stuff at the bottom of the frame, otherwise I like the framing and the shot in general. 6</td>', 'It''d be better off without the fluffy stuff at the bottom of the frame, otherwise I like the framing and the shot in general. 6', '2003-01-01 15:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(180807, 10221, 4007, '<td valign="top">Great framing.  Because the shirt is completely black, the arm reaching across her chest is impossible to see, and I think that gives the shot a somewhat awkward feel.  However, I do really like how the hand is holding the hat, so I don''t think the pose is all bad, but I think some contrast between the arm and the rest of the shirt would help.  7</td>', 'Great framing.  Because the shirt is completely black, the arm reaching across her chest is impossible to see, and I think that gives the shot a somewhat awkward feel.  However, I do really like how the hand is holding the hat, so I don''t think the pose is all bad, but I think some contrast between the arm and the rest of the shirt would help.  7', '2003-01-01 15:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(180808, 10324, 4007, '<td valign="top">The way the whiskers (especially the ones above the eyes) are much more illuminated than the rest of the face is really distracting to me here and it really takes away from my personal enjoyment of the shot.  The focus is great here, and aside from barely clipping that right ear off the framing is great as well.  An impressive shot. 7</td>', 'The way the whiskers (especially the ones above the eyes) are much more illuminated than the rest of the face is really distracting to me here and it really takes away from my personal enjoyment of the shot.  The focus is great here, and aside from barely clipping that right ear off the framing is great as well.  An impressive shot. 7', '2003-01-01 15:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(180809, 10310, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of this shot, but I''m not crazy about the background - it draws my eyes away from the subject.  Perhaps a high contrast background, such as white would have been effective.</td>', 'I really like the concept of this shot, but I''m not crazy about the background - it draws my eyes away from the subject.  Perhaps a high contrast background, such as white would have been effective.', '2003-01-01 15:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(180810, 10112, 2553, '<td valign="top">The photo of her is wonderful, and the soft lighting looks great in my opinion, but the background really draws my eyes away from her face.</td>', 'The photo of her is wonderful, and the soft lighting looks great in my opinion, but the background really draws my eyes away from her face.', '2003-01-01 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(180811, 10173, 2553, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but I think I would have preferred to see a tighter crop, and more contrast.</td>', 'A nice shot, but I think I would have preferred to see a tighter crop, and more contrast.', '2003-01-01 15:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(180812, 10130, 4007, '<td valign="top">the bookshelf behind is somewhat distracting.  I''m tempted to say I''d have cropped out the right side past his face, but I do like having the extra space, it''d just be better if there were nothing there.  Of course I understand this was probably unavoidable.  It looks like the light is a little bit harsh as well.  I do like the expression and the pose in general.  It''s a good shot. 7</td>', 'the bookshelf behind is somewhat distracting.  I''m tempted to say I''d have cropped out the right side past his face, but I do like having the extra space, it''d just be better if there were nothing there.  Of course I understand this was probably unavoidable.  It looks like the light is a little bit harsh as well.  I do like the expression and the pose in general.  It''s a good shot. 7', '2003-01-01 15:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(180813, 10293, 4007, '<td valign="top">The glass she is drinking out of has an abstract feel to it, but it doesn''t seem to fit the feel of the rest of the photo, and it ends up being distracting instead (at first I couldn''t figure out what it was).  I like the bright background and the darker face, and the tight close up works well here... there''s just something about that wine glass that seems like it almost worked but didn''t. Maybe it''s just that it obstructs the mouth, which is so vital to facial expression. But that''s just me. = )  6</td>', 'The glass she is drinking out of has an abstract feel to it, but it doesn''t seem to fit the feel of the rest of the photo, and it ends up being distracting instead (at first I couldn''t figure out what it was).  I like the bright background and the darker face, and the tight close up works well here... there''s just something about that wine glass that seems like it almost worked but didn''t. Maybe it''s just that it obstructs the mouth, which is so vital to facial expression. But that''s just me. = )  6', '2003-01-01 15:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(180814, 10296, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and a nice shot.  I would like to have seen the kind lighting that is used to fill in shadowed areas on portraits.  (I''m technically challenged in this area(lighting), so please forgive me.  I don''t know how to DO that kind of lighting, but I know what I would like to see!  Does that make sense??</td>', 'Nice composition and a nice shot.  I would like to have seen the kind lighting that is used to fill in shadowed areas on portraits.  (I''m technically challenged in this area(lighting), so please forgive me.  I don''t know how to DO that kind of lighting, but I know what I would like to see!  Does that make sense??', '2003-01-01 15:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(180815, 10183, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of this shot, but wish the model didn''t look so sad - a more sensual feel would have been very nice.  I would have cropped off quite a bit of the top - I just feel like I want a tighter crop on the subject.</td>', 'I like the softness of this shot, but wish the model didn''t look so sad - a more sensual feel would have been very nice.  I would have cropped off quite a bit of the top - I just feel like I want a tighter crop on the subject.', '2003-01-01 15:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(180816, 10129, 4007, '<td valign="top">Well.. the shot does a nice job of capturing that statue/figurine (the framing, contrast, focus and everything work well) but that''s really all it does is show us a figurine, straight on with a black background.  Forgive my bluntness, but I''m not personally inclined to consider that to be very valueable. 3</td>', 'Well.. the shot does a nice job of capturing that statue/figurine (the framing, contrast, focus and everything work well) but that''s really all it does is show us a figurine, straight on with a black background.  Forgive my bluntness, but I''m not personally inclined to consider that to be very valueable. 3', '2003-01-01 15:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(180817, 10127, 2553, '<td valign="top">So cute!  Nice lighting, wish I could manage as well.</td>', 'So cute!  Nice lighting, wish I could manage as well.', '2003-01-01 15:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(180818, 10322, 2553, '<td valign="top">I find the background to be somewhat distracting, and I sure wish she was looking at the camera- I want to get more of a sense of her personality.</td>', 'I find the background to be somewhat distracting, and I sure wish she was looking at the camera- I want to get more of a sense of her personality.', '2003-01-01 15:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(180819, 10318, 2553, '<td valign="top">Aaron looks very unsure about this.  Nice composition and DOF, although I still find the background a little bit distracting.</td>', 'Aaron looks very unsure about this.  Nice composition and DOF, although I still find the background a little bit distracting.', '2003-01-01 15:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(180820, 10183, 4007, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would help, although I think you might be leaving a wider shot in order to simulate an entire bathroom mirror with your shot.  I think the title is vital to the shot, as alone I don''t think it''s particularly impressive in terms of expression or portraiture, however, if I think of it as you actually looking into a bathroom mirror suddenly it all starts to fit and seems to capture a look of dull self-evaluation that strikes me as very real.  Although I could just be reading into it way to far.  8</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would help, although I think you might be leaving a wider shot in order to simulate an entire bathroom mirror with your shot.  I think the title is vital to the shot, as alone I don''t think it''s particularly impressive in terms of expression or portraiture, however, if I think of it as you actually looking into a bathroom mirror suddenly it all starts to fit and seems to capture a look of dull self-evaluation that strikes me as very real.  Although I could just be reading into it way to far.  8', '2003-01-01 15:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(180821, 10124, 4007, '<td valign="top">Great framing, I love the claw/talon (I lack the proper terminology) at the bottom.  Excelent shot.  Lighting might have been better without the two stripes, but it''s easily overlooked. 8</td>', 'Great framing, I love the claw/talon (I lack the proper terminology) at the bottom.  Excelent shot.  Lighting might have been better without the two stripes, but it''s easily overlooked. 8', '2003-01-01 15:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(180822, 10233, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m not saying this doesn''t meet the challenge, but I would consider this to be more of a candid photo of someone, than a portrait.  I would love to see a more intimate shot, more of a closeup of the young man.</td>', 'I''m not saying this doesn''t meet the challenge, but I would consider this to be more of a candid photo of someone, than a portrait.  I would love to see a more intimate shot, more of a closeup of the young man.', '2003-01-01 15:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(180823, 10244, 4007, '<td valign="top">Sorry.. the concept just doens''t do it for me.  The dog''s nose being cut off really hurts as well. 3</td>', 'Sorry.. the concept just doens''t do it for me.  The dog''s nose being cut off really hurts as well. 3', '2003-01-01 15:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(180824, 10239, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this shot, but it is much too dark for my taste, I really would like to see more contrast.</td>', 'I like the composition of this shot, but it is much too dark for my taste, I really would like to see more contrast.', '2003-01-01 15:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(180825, 10297, 2553, '<td valign="top">I find the background to be pretty distracting, but your capture of the dog is wonderful, and I love the "pose" you chose.  I wish  I could manage to get such great shots of my dogs.</td>', 'I find the background to be pretty distracting, but your capture of the dog is wonderful, and I love the "pose" you chose.  I wish  I could manage to get such great shots of my dogs.', '2003-01-01 16:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(180826, 10273, 2553, '<td valign="top">A terrific shot, I love that the young man is in sharp focus, and the Mom(?) is not.  More contrast would really make this a standout for me.</td>', 'A terrific shot, I love that the young man is in sharp focus, and the Mom(?) is not.  More contrast would really make this a standout for me.', '2003-01-01 16:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(180827, 10306, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very unique composition and perspective of things.  Maybe a tiny bit too much negative space on the right for my taste.</td>', 'Very unique composition and perspective of things.  Maybe a tiny bit too much negative space on the right for my taste.', '2003-01-01 16:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(180828, 10108, 2553, '<td valign="top">Unique, almost abstract looking.  Very much like the lighting you used.  Hard to get a sense of the person, but nevertheless a pretty cool shot.</td>', 'Unique, almost abstract looking.  Very much like the lighting you used.  Hard to get a sense of the person, but nevertheless a pretty cool shot.', '2003-01-01 16:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(180834, 10106, 4055, '<td valign="top">Very good. My top favoutite this week, Great composition and lighting. Really like the cropping. Well done!</td>', 'Very good. My top favoutite this week, Great composition and lighting. Really like the cropping. Well done!', '2003-01-01 16:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(180835, 10130, 4055, '<td valign="top">Love portraits that´s not studio work. Lovely shot. Lighting from window is perfect. Great composition. Well done! High score from Sweden.</td>', 'Love portraits that´s not studio work. Lovely shot. Lighting from window is perfect. Great composition. Well done! High score from Sweden.', '2003-01-01 16:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(180837, 10133, 4055, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Focus and composition is good. Perhaps some reflected light in his face at right would have made it more interesting. Anyway a good shot = high score.</td>', 'I like this one. Focus and composition is good. Perhaps some reflected light in his face at right would have made it more interesting. Anyway a good shot = high score.', '2003-01-01 16:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(180838, 10309, 4055, '<td valign="top">A very good portrait. Composition and lighting is perfect. I´m not so sure about the border. I like borders and I use them all the time myself, so it´s not that.  I had probably made it not so thick and in black - but it´s just this little thing called taste. Never mind I don´t count you down for that. High score for this lovely portrait.</td>', 'A very good portrait. Composition and lighting is perfect. I´m not so sure about the border. I like borders and I use them all the time myself, so it´s not that.  I had probably made it not so thick and in black - but it´s just this little thing called taste. Never mind I don´t count you down for that. High score for this lovely portrait.', '2003-01-01 17:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(180859, 10270, 5266, '<td valign="top">Lili is just beautiful!!  She looks like my Norman that passed away in November.  Good luck with the challenge!!<br/></td>', 'Lili is just beautiful!!  She looks like my Norman that passed away in November.  Good luck with the challenge!!', '2003-01-01 18:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(180882, 10117, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice crop, bg, exposure, focus.  Good expression.  Very nice!</td>', 'Nice crop, bg, exposure, focus.  Good expression.  Very nice!', '2003-01-01 19:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(180883, 10130, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Great lighting too.</td>', 'Very nice!  Great lighting too.', '2003-01-01 19:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(180885, 10315, 1280, '<td valign="top">I love this sweet face!  Good job!!!</td>', 'I love this sweet face!  Good job!!!', '2003-01-01 19:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(180887, 10324, 1280, '<td valign="top">I love all those highlighted whiskers!</td>', 'I love all those highlighted whiskers!', '2003-01-01 19:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(180917, 10304, 332, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Focus could be better.</td>', 'Good composition. Focus could be better.', '2003-01-01 20:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(180918, 10300, 332, '<td valign="top">Good contrast.</td>', 'Good contrast.', '2003-01-01 20:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(180920, 10088, 5934, '<td valign="top">nice puppy</td>', 'nice puppy', '2003-01-01 21:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(180922, 10309, 332, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Contrast is just right. Great composition.</td>', 'Good shot. Contrast is just right. Great composition.', '2003-01-01 21:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(180923, 10270, 332, '<td valign="top">Great composition... and a beautiful cat :)</td>', 'Great composition... and a beautiful cat :)', '2003-01-01 21:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(180925, 10133, 332, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the man in the right side of the frame. When you look at a picture you look at it from the left side to the right. And with the man on the left side you just stop. Good picture though. One of my highest rated in this challenge. (arnit)</td>', 'I would like to see the man in the right side of the frame. When you look at a picture you look at it from the left side to the right. And with the man on the left side you just stop. Good picture though. One of my highest rated in this challenge. (arnit)', '2003-01-01 21:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(180926, 10296, 332, '<td valign="top">Good composition.</td>', 'Good composition.', '2003-01-01 21:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(180929, 10319, 332, '<td valign="top">You could crop the picture better. The black thing on the left side is distracting. Excellent contrast and good composition. One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'You could crop the picture better. The black thing on the left side is distracting. Excellent contrast and good composition. One of my favorites this week.', '2003-01-01 21:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(180931, 10156, 332, '<td valign="top">Good composition.</td>', 'Good composition.', '2003-01-01 21:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(180939, 10213, 332, '<td valign="top">Good contrast. Good use of DOF. And a beautiful model :)</td>', 'Good contrast. Good use of DOF. And a beautiful model :)', '2003-01-01 21:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(180945, 10213, 5068, '<td valign="top">This is a breathtaking photo, zwhere as i can find clearly defined raits of the face I can also experience a very nice feeling in the background of the picture.</td>', 'This is a breathtaking photo, zwhere as i can find clearly defined raits of the face I can also experience a very nice feeling in the background of the picture.', '2003-01-01 21:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(180949, 10243, 332, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes.', '2003-01-01 21:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(180960, 10133, 4007, '<td valign="top">Somewhat similar to my shot.  I like the framing and the shadow a lot.  The face here strikes me as being remarkably crisp and smooth, with a perfect complexion (almost to the point of looking surreal or made up) which creates an interesting effect.  It might have improved it slightly if the lighting weren''t more concentrated on the cheek than the forhead.  Great shot though. 8</td>', 'Somewhat similar to my shot.  I like the framing and the shadow a lot.  The face here strikes me as being remarkably crisp and smooth, with a perfect complexion (almost to the point of looking surreal or made up) which creates an interesting effect.  It might have improved it slightly if the lighting weren''t more concentrated on the cheek than the forhead.  Great shot though. 8', '2003-01-01 22:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(180962, 10146, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it was intentional, but the two expressions almost seem to be contrasting.  His seems harsh and almost disapproving with a hint of happiness, while hers seems nostalgic and somehow both joyed and desperate (for returned affection?).  I''m probably reading into it too far, but that''s how they strike me.  This is enhanced by the fact that he is slightly more in the foreground than she is, and he dominates the frame, suggesting more power than she does.  His skin tones are darker as well.  Intentional or not, it is an extremely interesting (and for me, effective) dynamic.  However, your title leads me to believe that wasn''t the expression you were going for at all.. I could be wrong though.  Great shot. 8</td>', 'I''m not sure if it was intentional, but the two expressions almost seem to be contrasting.  His seems harsh and almost disapproving with a hint of happiness, while hers seems nostalgic and somehow both joyed and desperate (for returned affection?).  I''m probably reading into it too far, but that''s how they strike me.  This is enhanced by the fact that he is slightly more in the foreground than she is, and he dominates the frame, suggesting more power than she does.  His skin tones are darker as well.  Intentional or not, it is an extremely interesting (and for me, effective) dynamic.  However, your title leads me to believe that wasn''t the expression you were going for at all.. I could be wrong though.  Great shot. 8', '2003-01-01 22:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(180963, 10192, 4007, '<td valign="top">The shadow behind him detracts from the shot.  At the bottom of the shot there isn''t enough contrast between the background and his legs, which tend to look awkward because of it.  The striped thing he''s sitting on tends to distract as well.  Perhaps cropping just above the knee would have been a good idea.  I like the pose, but it''s hard to see the details of the face and such.  Perhaps a closer shot with a horizontal orientation would have worked well.  Overall this is a good shot, but it has some detracting factors to it. 5</td>', 'The shadow behind him detracts from the shot.  At the bottom of the shot there isn''t enough contrast between the background and his legs, which tend to look awkward because of it.  The striped thing he''s sitting on tends to distract as well.  Perhaps cropping just above the knee would have been a good idea.  I like the pose, but it''s hard to see the details of the face and such.  Perhaps a closer shot with a horizontal orientation would have worked well.  Overall this is a good shot, but it has some detracting factors to it. 5', '2003-01-01 22:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(180966, 10112, 4007, '<td valign="top">The whole shot has a sort of artificial feel to it.  The unnatural pose, the empty picture frame, the perfect facial complexion.. I almost feel surprised to see little fuzzies stuck to the gloves and shirt because of the touched up department store catalog perfection of everything else in the shot.  That has it''s plusses and minuses.  6</td>', 'The whole shot has a sort of artificial feel to it.  The unnatural pose, the empty picture frame, the perfect facial complexion.. I almost feel surprised to see little fuzzies stuck to the gloves and shirt because of the touched up department store catalog perfection of everything else in the shot.  That has it''s plusses and minuses.  6', '2003-01-01 22:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(180983, 10189, 5940, '<td valign="top">nice subject, could be more centered on the face, the hand with cigarette calls attention more than expression on man''s face, but overall good</td>', 'nice subject, could be more centered on the face, the hand with cigarette calls attention more than expression on man''s face, but overall good', '2003-01-01 23:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(180986, 10307, 5940, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and shadowing effect, subject is strong and captures attention.<br/></td>', 'nice lighting and shadowing effect, subject is strong and captures attention.', '2003-01-01 23:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(180987, 10118, 5940, '<td valign="top">subject is common, lighting could help cause more of a dramatic effect, picture is lacking</td>', 'subject is common, lighting could help cause more of a dramatic effect, picture is lacking', '2003-01-01 23:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(180990, 10130, 5940, '<td valign="top">Great picture, expresses emotion, lighting is good, subject is well chosen and photographed, nice dramatic effect</td>', 'Great picture, expresses emotion, lighting is good, subject is well chosen and photographed, nice dramatic effect', '2003-01-01 23:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(181061, 10315, 5942, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. Its very clear and sharp, I also like the detail in the eyes and on the nose. Cool Photo!</td>', 'I really like this photo. Its very clear and sharp, I also like the detail in the eyes and on the nose. Cool Photo!', '2003-01-02 00:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(181078, 10315, 5223, '<td valign="top">Well done a great photo works so well in B+W</td>', 'Well done a great photo works so well in B+W', '2003-01-02 01:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(181080, 10243, 5223, '<td valign="top">Well done a Great Photo works so well in B+W</td>', 'Well done a Great Photo works so well in B+W', '2003-01-02 01:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
