(181097, 10318, 5212, '<td valign="top">I like the way that this person''s personality is portrayed in this photo.  Also, like composition and lighting. 8</td>', 'I like the way that this person''s personality is portrayed in this photo.  Also, like composition and lighting. 8', '2003-01-02 01:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
