(181696, 10309, 3724, '<td valign="top">I love the square shape of this intimate close up, it is cropped perfectly....    the tonality of light and shadow is superior and competes to my eyes with any b&amp;w zone system -  film based image............... 9</td>', 'I love the square shape of this intimate close up, it is cropped perfectly....    the tonality of light and shadow is superior and competes to my eyes with any b&w zone system -  film based image............... 9', '2003-01-03 02:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
