(181975, 10270, 2130, '<td valign="top">really good, I like the stuff in the forground being out of focus.</td>', 'really good, I like the stuff in the forground being out of focus.', '2003-01-03 15:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(181979, 10304, 2130, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot, is it out of focus or do we have ourselves a little movement there, if it was clearer I would have given it an 8, but feel I can´t give u more than a 6, better luck next time, this was a really good idea :)</td>', 'wonderful shot, is it out of focus or do we have ourselves a little movement there, if it was clearer I would have given it an 8, but feel I can´t give u more than a 6, better luck next time, this was a really good idea :)', '2003-01-03 15:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(182001, 10156, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful portrait.  One of my favorites for the challenge!  I love that smile, you caught him just at the right second.  Great use of background... doesn''t detract from the boy, and is interesting, almost gives it more of a 3d look.  I also love your cropping which is very pleasing to the eye.  Beautiful use of black and white!  Solid 10!  Great job!</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful portrait.  One of my favorites for the challenge!  I love that smile, you caught him just at the right second.  Great use of background... doesn''t detract from the boy, and is interesting, almost gives it more of a 3d look.  I also love your cropping which is very pleasing to the eye.  Beautiful use of black and white!  Solid 10!  Great job!', '2003-01-03 15:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(182003, 10123, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great use of contrast here!  Really a very striking picture!  I love the placement of the lips and the eye.  Only thing that bothers me is the very bottom between the two posts... Not sure whats there... but it detracts slightly from the photo... Still a solid 9!  Nice job.</td>', 'Great use of contrast here!  Really a very striking picture!  I love the placement of the lips and the eye.  Only thing that bothers me is the very bottom between the two posts... Not sure whats there... but it detracts slightly from the photo... Still a solid 9!  Nice job.', '2003-01-03 15:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(182006, 10245, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very cool and imaginative... her eyes are really intense looking!  I love the shadows you used here.  I think I would have liked a little less black space at the top, and it would have been nice to see her entire reflection possibly... originally had you at a 7, now I''m putting you at an 8.  Great job!</td>', 'Very cool and imaginative... her eyes are really intense looking!  I love the shadows you used here.  I think I would have liked a little less black space at the top, and it would have been nice to see her entire reflection possibly... originally had you at a 7, now I''m putting you at an 8.  Great job!', '2003-01-03 15:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(182008, 10306, 4967, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of black and white here.  Very interesting cropping, I think it works pretty well.  Excellent detail and lighting, except that you lose just a bit due to shadows on the ear.  Otherwise a very nice overall portrait.  Nice job.</td>', 'Excellent use of black and white here.  Very interesting cropping, I think it works pretty well.  Excellent detail and lighting, except that you lose just a bit due to shadows on the ear.  Otherwise a very nice overall portrait.  Nice job.', '2003-01-03 16:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(182010, 10331, 4967, '<td valign="top">I think the border you added detracts from the photo.  The lighting seems much too harsh on the right side of your face.  Would have liked to have seen the whole ear, and your head, maybe ending with more white background might have been neat.  Good job on having a solid background.  I''m not sure if I care for the contrast on this photo or not.  Your hair helps.  Love the way you have even the tips of the hair in the picture.</td>', 'I think the border you added detracts from the photo.  The lighting seems much too harsh on the right side of your face.  Would have liked to have seen the whole ear, and your head, maybe ending with more white background might have been neat.  Good job on having a solid background.  I''m not sure if I care for the contrast on this photo or not.  Your hair helps.  Love the way you have even the tips of the hair in the picture.', '2003-01-03 16:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(182014, 10226, 4967, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t get it, I thought you were making a comment on the guy.  Now I do :-)  it''s a dog''s point of view, which is interesting.  However the photo itself is not extremely attractive to me.  The contrast is the firs thing that gets me, as everything looks pretty much the same grey.  Also this angle is not particularly flattering.  I would have suggested cropping more off the left side, maybe to the other side of the far doorway?</td>', 'At first I didn''t get it, I thought you were making a comment on the guy.  Now I do :-)  it''s a dog''s point of view, which is interesting.  However the photo itself is not extremely attractive to me.  The contrast is the firs thing that gets me, as everything looks pretty much the same grey.  Also this angle is not particularly flattering.  I would have suggested cropping more off the left side, maybe to the other side of the far doorway?', '2003-01-03 16:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(182015, 10309, 4967, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the border suits the photo, it is too brash for this beautiful soft looking woman.  Gorgeous ligthing, and great focus, nice subject, and lovely cropping.  Great use of contrast and black and white, she almost looks like a porcelin doll!  Beautiful job.  At first I put this at 9 because of the border, but I think I''m going to overlook the border, and base it off the picture, which to me is a good 10.  Congrats!  and good luck!</td>', 'I don''t think the border suits the photo, it is too brash for this beautiful soft looking woman.  Gorgeous ligthing, and great focus, nice subject, and lovely cropping.  Great use of contrast and black and white, she almost looks like a porcelin doll!  Beautiful job.  At first I put this at 9 because of the border, but I think I''m going to overlook the border, and base it off the picture, which to me is a good 10.  Congrats!  and good luck!', '2003-01-03 16:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(182016, 10189, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent moody, well composed shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Excellent moody, well composed shot. Nice work.', '2003-01-03 16:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(182017, 10133, 5598, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I love these really shadowwy pictures.</td>', 'I like it.  I love these really shadowwy pictures.', '2003-01-03 16:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(182018, 10213, 5598, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job!  I love the use of shadows and light.  Perfect DOF for this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful job!  I love the use of shadows and light.  Perfect DOF for this shot.', '2003-01-03 16:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(182041, 10323, 4007, '<td valign="top">Whatever the flag/stick thing in the front is, it''s quite distracting to the shot.  It seems you incorporated it intentionally, (I''d assume it has some significance to fishing), but it''d have been much better if it didn''t obstruct your main subject. 5</td>', 'Whatever the flag/stick thing in the front is, it''s quite distracting to the shot.  It seems you incorporated it intentionally, (I''d assume it has some significance to fishing), but it''d have been much better if it didn''t obstruct your main subject. 5', '2003-01-03 17:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(182043, 10263, 4007, '<td valign="top">The one shadowed eye really hurts this shot a lot.  Having an eye shadowed really doesn''t fit with the tone of this shot at all.  Otherwise, this is a wonderful shot that I really enjoy.  Nice crop. Without the shadow over the eye this is probably a 9.  As is, I''ll say a 7.</td>', 'The one shadowed eye really hurts this shot a lot.  Having an eye shadowed really doesn''t fit with the tone of this shot at all.  Otherwise, this is a wonderful shot that I really enjoy.  Nice crop. Without the shadow over the eye this is probably a 9.  As is, I''ll say a 7.', '2003-01-03 17:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(182058, 10213, 5980, '<td valign="top">Well done ! Nice girl !</td>', 'Well done ! Nice girl !', '2003-01-03 18:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(182102, 10233, 3020, '<td valign="top">If not for the motion blur this would be an interesting photo. 5<br/></td>', 'If not for the motion blur this would be an interesting photo. 5', '2003-01-03 19:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(182108, 10193, 4007, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty much like a standard snapshot.  It needs some more unique framing, lighting, or subject matter I think. 3</td>', 'Looks pretty much like a standard snapshot.  It needs some more unique framing, lighting, or subject matter I think. 3', '2003-01-03 20:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(182131, 10281, 5972, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.</td>', 'Excellent composition.', '2003-01-03 23:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(182168, 10243, 5433, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful capture. Distant mystic eyes looking somewhere else. I like the DOF on woman''s right eye. Good cropping!</td>', 'This is wonderful capture. Distant mystic eyes looking somewhere else. I like the DOF on woman''s right eye. Good cropping!', '2003-01-04 04:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(182173, 10156, 5433, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful capture. Really good cropping and facial expression. I would like to have a little more contrast, because I feel that the face is a little too grey.</td>', 'This is wonderful capture. Really good cropping and facial expression. I would like to have a little more contrast, because I feel that the face is a little too grey.', '2003-01-04 04:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(182175, 10189, 5433, '<td valign="top">Everything seems to be in right order here. The feeling is a little bit too perfect - I wonder if this shot has not been set up in a studio like environment etc. Anyhow this is really good portrait.</td>', 'Everything seems to be in right order here. The feeling is a little bit too perfect - I wonder if this shot has not been set up in a studio like environment etc. Anyhow this is really good portrait.', '2003-01-04 04:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(182265, 10156, 3018, '<td valign="top">Very natural expression.  Contrast and focus are great.  I love the composition, how the boy is on the right part of the frame.  My favorite this week.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very natural expression.  Contrast and focus are great.  I love the composition, how the boy is on the right part of the frame.  My favorite this week.  Good luck!', '2003-01-04 13:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(182266, 10305, 3018, '<td valign="top">She looks like Uma Thurman.  :)  I like the high contrast in this picture.  The pose is also nice.  Her eyes look great!  Good luck!</td>', 'She looks like Uma Thurman.  :)  I like the high contrast in this picture.  The pose is also nice.  Her eyes look great!  Good luck!', '2003-01-04 13:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(182267, 10309, 3018, '<td valign="top">I like the soft lighting and your composition.  Cropping is very nice.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like the soft lighting and your composition.  Cropping is very nice.  Good luck!', '2003-01-04 13:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(182273, 10133, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love the incredible shadow, with just a hint of browbone catching the light on that side.  Incredible, and handsome, too!</td>', 'Wow!  I love the incredible shadow, with just a hint of browbone catching the light on that side.  Incredible, and handsome, too!', '2003-01-04 14:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(182275, 10296, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love the catchlights in her eyes!</td>', 'I love the catchlights in her eyes!', '2003-01-04 14:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(182276, 10335, 1379, '<td valign="top">Intense!     I love it!</td>', 'Intense!     I love it!', '2003-01-04 14:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(182277, 10315, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a sweet little kitty!!!</td>', 'What a sweet little kitty!!!', '2003-01-04 14:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(182278, 10106, 1379, '<td valign="top">Love those triple catchlights!  His stubbly beard makes this shot extra incredible!  I love it!</td>', 'Love those triple catchlights!  His stubbly beard makes this shot extra incredible!  I love it!', '2003-01-04 14:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(182280, 10192, 1031, '<td valign="top">The bottom 40% doesn''t do that much for me, so I''d consider cropping just below his hands to make a nearly square rectangle. I really like to tone range, detail, and composition/expression of the upper part.</td>', 'The bottom 40% doesn''t do that much for me, so I''d consider cropping just below his hands to make a nearly square rectangle. I really like to tone range, detail, and composition/expression of the upper part.', '2003-01-04 15:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(182281, 10333, 1031, '<td valign="top">Glare on her glasses bothers me a little -- too bad we can''t use the dodge/burn tool...it MIGHT be possible to tweak it with a tone curve.</td>', 'Glare on her glasses bothers me a little -- too bad we can''t use the dodge/burn tool...it MIGHT be possible to tweak it with a tone curve.', '2003-01-04 15:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(182282, 10306, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like your unusual composition. I''d try having his head turned SLIGHTLY more to the left so that his eyes are a little more rotated. I think it would heighten the impression I got that he was looking off into the empty space, and that his eyes just snapped back towards the camera when he noticed the picture being taken.</td>', 'I like your unusual composition. I''d try having his head turned SLIGHTLY more to the left so that his eyes are a little more rotated. I think it would heighten the impression I got that he was looking off into the empty space, and that his eyes just snapped back towards the camera when he noticed the picture being taken.', '2003-01-04 15:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(182283, 10162, 1031, '<td valign="top">I want an invite to the CD Release Party!</td>', 'I want an invite to the CD Release Party!', '2003-01-04 15:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(182285, 10193, 1031, '<td valign="top">"If you want to avoid claw marks on your LCD, this better be the LAST shot!"<br/>I''m glad to see people not being stuck in the "portrait" orientation, but I''m not sure you need the extra space on the sides here. Good job with exposure/tone range.</td>', '"If you want to avoid claw marks on your LCD, this better be the LAST shot!"I''m glad to see people not being stuck in the "portrait" orientation, but I''m not sure you need the extra space on the sides here. Good job with exposure/tone range.', '2003-01-04 15:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(182287, 10213, 1031, '<td valign="top">Just a little more shadow detail in the hair would be nice, but is not a critical point to me.</td>', 'Just a little more shadow detail in the hair would be nice, but is not a critical point to me.', '2003-01-04 16:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(182289, 10138, 1031, '<td valign="top">Only minor tweak I''d do is to rotate slightly CCW so the main dark/light boundary at the top right is more horizontal -- I don''t think it would affect her pose adversely.</td>', 'Only minor tweak I''d do is to rotate slightly CCW so the main dark/light boundary at the top right is more horizontal -- I don''t think it would affect her pose adversely.', '2003-01-04 16:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(182290, 10307, 4007, '<td valign="top">The effect almost seems overdone, but it''s very effective and it''s a good photo.  I can see this shot in some newsweek article about what''s happening to today''s youth. 7</td>', 'The effect almost seems overdone, but it''s very effective and it''s a good photo.  I can see this shot in some newsweek article about what''s happening to today''s youth. 7', '2003-01-04 16:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(182291, 10231, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good job keeping her hair sharp and skin tones smooth. Wish those two circles right by her chin were a  half-inch to the left.</td>', 'Good job keeping her hair sharp and skin tones smooth. Wish those two circles right by her chin were a  half-inch to the left.', '2003-01-04 16:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(182292, 10331, 4007, '<td valign="top">It looks like there''s a glare on the glasses, which blurs the eye.  The black hair contrasts wonderfully with the background.  I like the framing as well.  Nice shot. 7</td>', 'It looks like there''s a glare on the glasses, which blurs the eye.  The black hair contrasts wonderfully with the background.  I like the framing as well.  Nice shot. 7', '2003-01-04 16:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(182294, 10329, 1031, '<td valign="top">You picked clothing to make this especially challenging. I''d try diffusing/angling one of the lights so you only get one specular highlight in each eye; maybe I''m just not used to seeing two so distinctly.</td>', 'You picked clothing to make this especially challenging. I''d try diffusing/angling one of the lights so you only get one specular highlight in each eye; maybe I''m just not used to seeing two so distinctly.', '2003-01-04 16:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(182295, 10322, 4007, '<td valign="top">It would be better without the shadow from the flash, and it would help if she were looking a bit more towards the camera. 5</td>', 'It would be better without the shadow from the flash, and it would help if she were looking a bit more towards the camera. 5', '2003-01-04 16:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(182296, 10331, 1031, '<td valign="top">Well-done high-key image. I''m not sure I''d have bordered it just the way you did, but it''s creative and works OK with this image.</td>', 'Well-done high-key image. I''m not sure I''d have bordered it just the way you did, but it''s creative and works OK with this image.', '2003-01-04 16:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(182297, 10306, 4007, '<td valign="top">It''s so nice to see a more unique shot among all these portrait entries.  The amount of negative space on the right side might be a little overkill, but I like that it''s there in the first place.  Cropping the mouth out produces a very intresting effect, because it forces the eyes to provide all the expression, which works well here.  I''m not sure if I would have left the entire nose in or if I would have cropped it just a little bit higher, but that''s something I think I''d have to tweak and see how it looked.  Anyway, a great shot that I enjoyed very much. 8</td>', 'It''s so nice to see a more unique shot among all these portrait entries.  The amount of negative space on the right side might be a little overkill, but I like that it''s there in the first place.  Cropping the mouth out produces a very intresting effect, because it forces the eyes to provide all the expression, which works well here.  I''m not sure if I would have left the entire nose in or if I would have cropped it just a little bit higher, but that''s something I think I''d have to tweak and see how it looked.  Anyway, a great shot that I enjoyed very much. 8', '2003-01-04 16:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(182300, 10303, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks just a little bright or overly contrasty for the "mood" of this photo.</td>', 'Looks just a little bright or overly contrasty for the "mood" of this photo.', '2003-01-04 16:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(182301, 10150, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why it''s scaled down to smaller proportions than necessary (perhaps for image quality problems?).  It''s a good snapshot, but it doesn''t offer much in the way of a unique or dramatic presentation of your subject.  Playing around with a different crop, a closer shot, different lighting, or a different perspective might make for a more interesting shot.</td>', 'I''m not sure why it''s scaled down to smaller proportions than necessary (perhaps for image quality problems?).  It''s a good snapshot, but it doesn''t offer much in the way of a unique or dramatic presentation of your subject.  Playing around with a different crop, a closer shot, different lighting, or a different perspective might make for a more interesting shot.', '2003-01-04 16:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(182302, 10088, 1031, '<td valign="top">Expressive subject, great DOF and exposure.</td>', 'Expressive subject, great DOF and exposure.', '2003-01-04 16:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(182304, 10088, 4007, '<td valign="top">The eye really stands out, which is a good thing.  The shot as a whole is somewhat uninteresting though. 4</td>', 'The eye really stands out, which is a good thing.  The shot as a whole is somewhat uninteresting though. 4', '2003-01-04 16:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(182305, 10153, 4007, '<td valign="top">Great facial expressions</td>', 'Great facial expressions', '2003-01-04 16:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(182306, 10119, 4007, '<td valign="top">The tone of the title doesn''t seem to fit the shot.</td>', 'The tone of the title doesn''t seem to fit the shot.', '2003-01-04 16:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(182308, 10115, 4007, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot a lot.  The raggedness of it is very effective.  The crop is great, lighting is good, everything else seems sound.  Nice work. 8</td>', 'I really like this shot a lot.  The raggedness of it is very effective.  The crop is great, lighting is good, everything else seems sound.  Nice work. 8', '2003-01-04 16:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(182309, 10243, 4007, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Excelent shot. 9</td>', 'Wow.  Excelent shot. 9', '2003-01-04 16:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(182310, 10118, 1031, '<td valign="top">Only minor "complaint" is that it looks as though her hands are tilted towards the camera, making her top hand took a little too large proportionally. I''d have positioned the hands nearer the left shoulder. Also, if you can bring her forward without casting too much shadow you might be able to blur the background more and get "draped" rather than creased look.</td>', 'Only minor "complaint" is that it looks as though her hands are tilted towards the camera, making her top hand took a little too large proportionally. I''d have positioned the hands nearer the left shoulder. Also, if you can bring her forward without casting too much shadow you might be able to blur the background more and get "draped" rather than creased look.', '2003-01-04 16:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(182311, 10252, 4007, '<td valign="top">Interesting, and at least it doesn''t look the same as every other photo submitted, but I don''t think the grainy look works. 5</td>', 'Interesting, and at least it doesn''t look the same as every other photo submitted, but I don''t think the grainy look works. 5', '2003-01-04 16:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(182312, 10296, 4007, '<td valign="top">The shadow of the hand seems to detract from what is otherwise a good straightforward portrait. 5</td>', 'The shadow of the hand seems to detract from what is otherwise a good straightforward portrait. 5', '2003-01-04 16:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(182313, 10226, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d think a dog would see in higher contrast...</td>', 'I''d think a dog would see in higher contrast...', '2003-01-04 16:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(182315, 10162, 4007, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and perspective. 7</td>', 'Nice framing and perspective. 7', '2003-01-04 16:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(182316, 10179, 1031, '<td valign="top">Maybe a DPC ribbon would cheer her up...</td>', 'Maybe a DPC ribbon would cheer her up...', '2003-01-04 16:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(182317, 10305, 4007, '<td valign="top">The blown out effect seems particularly ineffective with that hand.  It loses all it''s definition and detail, yet it''s a main focal point of the photo.</td>', 'The blown out effect seems particularly ineffective with that hand.  It loses all it''s definition and detail, yet it''s a main focal point of the photo.', '2003-01-04 16:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(182318, 10310, 4007, '<td valign="top">More contrast between the hair and the background would have helped a lot. 5</td>', 'More contrast between the hair and the background would have helped a lot. 5', '2003-01-04 16:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(182319, 10207, 4007, '<td valign="top">Unique.. but I just don''t think the concept produced an appealing photo.</td>', 'Unique.. but I just don''t think the concept produced an appealing photo.', '2003-01-04 16:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(182320, 10166, 1031, '<td valign="top">"Please let me refrain from making the obvious joke..."<br/>Very nice candid portrait.</td>', '"Please let me refrain from making the obvious joke..."Very nice candid portrait.', '2003-01-04 16:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(182322, 10117, 1031, '<td valign="top">In this case, I think I''d crop off the brighert part on the left, and let her head fall right on the centerline. The rightmost 80% or so has beautiful lighting and detail.</td>', 'In this case, I think I''d crop off the brighert part on the left, and let her head fall right on the centerline. The rightmost 80% or so has beautiful lighting and detail.', '2003-01-04 16:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(182323, 10335, 4007, '<td valign="top">Whoah.. I think this needed a little deeper depth of field, because with those high contrast facial details all slightly out of focus it starts to look his face is rotting off or something.  That might be a bit extreme, but it certainly isn''t a desireable effect.</td>', 'Whoah.. I think this needed a little deeper depth of field, because with those high contrast facial details all slightly out of focus it starts to look his face is rotting off or something.  That might be a bit extreme, but it certainly isn''t a desireable effect.', '2003-01-04 16:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(182324, 10259, 1031, '<td valign="top">Details got just a little too blown-out on the left (for my taste -- I know it might be on purpose).</td>', 'Details got just a little too blown-out on the left (for my taste -- I know it might be on purpose).', '2003-01-04 16:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(182334, 10269, 5009, '<td valign="top">cute, but her middlefinger looks kinda uhhh chopped !?! (is that the reason she''s crying??? :)</td>', 'cute, but her middlefinger looks kinda uhhh chopped !?! (is that the reason she''s crying??? :)', '2003-01-04 17:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(182337, 10281, 5598, '<td valign="top">She is adorable!</td>', 'She is adorable!', '2003-01-04 18:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(182338, 10239, 5598, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shadows.  Very expressive.</td>', 'Nice use of shadows.  Very expressive.', '2003-01-04 18:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(182339, 10239, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very emotive.  The blue feelings in this shot are amazing.  I hope he''s feeling a bit more optimistic these days.</td>', 'Very emotive.  The blue feelings in this shot are amazing.  I hope he''s feeling a bit more optimistic these days.', '2003-01-04 18:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(182340, 10119, 1379, '<td valign="top">Your model reminds me a bit of Peter Gabriel these days.  Nice choice of a dark background.</td>', 'Your model reminds me a bit of Peter Gabriel these days.  Nice choice of a dark background.', '2003-01-04 18:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(182341, 10243, 1379, '<td valign="top">This is such a sultry photo!  I like it!</td>', 'This is such a sultry photo!  I like it!', '2003-01-04 18:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(182342, 10130, 1379, '<td valign="top">I like the light on this model.  Very sharp.  I love this man''s expression.  You really captured him in a moment of repose, it seems.  He reminds me a bit of my own father, which makes my vote increase!</td>', 'I like the light on this model.  Very sharp.  I love this man''s expression.  You really captured him in a moment of repose, it seems.  He reminds me a bit of my own father, which makes my vote increase!', '2003-01-04 18:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(182343, 10270, 1379, '<td valign="top">She''s very cute!  I love her little mouth and cheeks.  She looks as if she''s caught something!</td>', 'She''s very cute!  I love her little mouth and cheeks.  She looks as if she''s caught something!', '2003-01-04 18:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(182345, 10285, 1379, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww!  The little one in the foreground looks like she''s just woken up to see what you''re doing there.  What a cozy, loving scene.  I love it!</td>', 'Awwwwww!  The little one in the foreground looks like she''s just woken up to see what you''re doing there.  What a cozy, loving scene.  I love it!', '2003-01-04 18:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(182346, 10173, 1379, '<td valign="top">So crisp!  The sharp focus is awesome on this photo!</td>', 'So crisp!  The sharp focus is awesome on this photo!', '2003-01-04 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(182348, 10326, 1379, '<td valign="top">A Johnny Depp-alike!  Nice shot!</td>', 'A Johnny Depp-alike!  Nice shot!', '2003-01-04 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(182363, 10259, 4007, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit harsh on the side, although it produces a somewhat interesting effect, and the more I look at it I kind of like it.  A nice shot.  I think the title is a bit overdone though.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit harsh on the side, although it produces a somewhat interesting effect, and the more I look at it I kind of like it.  A nice shot.  I think the title is a bit overdone though.', '2003-01-04 19:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(182365, 10269, 4007, '<td valign="top">Wow.. I''m not sure how you pulled off that pose, but that''s a very impressive shot. 8</td>', 'Wow.. I''m not sure how you pulled off that pose, but that''s a very impressive shot. 8', '2003-01-04 19:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(182366, 10166, 4007, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a subject....</td>', 'That''s quite a subject....', '2003-01-04 19:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(182367, 10227, 4007, '<td valign="top">Daring.. I''m not sure about the crop though.  I think it''d have been better to either show the second eye entirely or not show any of it.. 6</td>', 'Daring.. I''m not sure about the crop though.  I think it''d have been better to either show the second eye entirely or not show any of it.. 6', '2003-01-04 19:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(182370, 10152, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about this shooting angle.. it seems to produce awkward results.  Also, a little room between the edge of the photo and the arm at the top would have been good. 5</td>', 'I''m not sure about this shooting angle.. it seems to produce awkward results.  Also, a little room between the edge of the photo and the arm at the top would have been good. 5', '2003-01-04 19:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(182372, 10223, 4007, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  I particularly like how the black pants blend into the background.  The facial expression and pose in general are great.  I think the wide framing works well.  Good work. 8</td>', 'I love this shot.  I particularly like how the black pants blend into the background.  The facial expression and pose in general are great.  I think the wide framing works well.  Good work. 8', '2003-01-04 19:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(182374, 10156, 4007, '<td valign="top">The hair really stands out.  The background is great. The crop works well, and the expression is of course perfect. excelent shot. 9</td>', 'The hair really stands out.  The background is great. The crop works well, and the expression is of course perfect. excelent shot. 9', '2003-01-04 19:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(182378, 10318, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the position of the head. Not head on, but a bit sideway''s, nice touch.<br/>Good exposure, good dof. Nice lighting. It is one of a few picture''s my eye is drawn to when I look at the thumbnails.</td>', 'I like the position of the head. Not head on, but a bit sideway''s, nice touch.Good exposure, good dof. Nice lighting. It is one of a few picture''s my eye is drawn to when I look at the thumbnails.', '2003-01-04 19:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(182380, 10106, 3032, '<td valign="top">A bit scary with those eyes wide open. Nice crop, good exposure. A bit grainy, but is seems to add something.</td>', 'A bit scary with those eyes wide open. Nice crop, good exposure. A bit grainy, but is seems to add something.', '2003-01-04 19:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(182382, 10186, 5826, '<td valign="top">Not my gumdrop buttons...<br/></td>', 'Not my gumdrop buttons...', '2003-01-04 19:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(182385, 10221, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the position in which she is portrayed. Exposure and stuff like that is good, but the lighting leaves one thing to be desired and that is the shadow from the hair on her face. I can''t see a shadow of the hat or on the background, so that is good.</td>', 'I like the position in which she is portrayed. Exposure and stuff like that is good, but the lighting leaves one thing to be desired and that is the shadow from the hair on her face. I can''t see a shadow of the hat or on the background, so that is good.', '2003-01-04 19:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(182390, 10192, 3032, '<td valign="top">A good year. :-)<br/> <br/>Good exposure. Lighting left some hard shadows on the background -/-.</td>', 'A good year. :-) Good exposure. Lighting left some hard shadows on the background -/-.', '2003-01-04 19:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(182393, 10115, 3032, '<td valign="top">Looks like a classic selfportrait of a painter. Interesting.</td>', 'Looks like a classic selfportrait of a painter. Interesting.', '2003-01-04 19:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(182394, 10149, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well done!</td>', 'Great idea and well done!', '2003-01-04 19:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(182398, 10129, 3032, '<td valign="top">Pretty good picture, don''t think that the bigger black space at the left was really necessary. The lighting &amp; exposure is very good, as well as the depth of focus.<br/>It put a smile on my face when I saw it.</td>', 'Pretty good picture, don''t think that the bigger black space at the left was really necessary. The lighting & exposure is very good, as well as the depth of focus.It put a smile on my face when I saw it.', '2003-01-04 19:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(182400, 10319, 3032, '<td valign="top">The balance of lighting has to big extremes for my taste.</td>', 'The balance of lighting has to big extremes for my taste.', '2003-01-04 19:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(182420, 10324, 1255, '<td valign="top">Nice job capturing this kitty.  I love the light reflecting off of her whiskers. I do wish the ear on the left side was not cut off though.</td>', 'Nice job capturing this kitty.  I love the light reflecting off of her whiskers. I do wish the ear on the left side was not cut off though.', '2003-01-04 20:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(182421, 10156, 1255, '<td valign="top">Good composition/cropping.  Very photogenic kid.</td>', 'Good composition/cropping.  Very photogenic kid.', '2003-01-04 20:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(182422, 10315, 1255, '<td valign="top">Amazing eyes.  Well chosen close up and cropping.  8</td>', 'Amazing eyes.  Well chosen close up and cropping.  8', '2003-01-04 20:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(182424, 10227, 1255, '<td valign="top">I like the effect you are going for here, but I wish there was less black on the left and a bit more of her face on the right.</td>', 'I like the effect you are going for here, but I wish there was less black on the left and a bit more of her face on the right.', '2003-01-04 20:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(182425, 10213, 1255, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait.  Beautiful capture of a beautiful lady. I think you''ll be in the top 3 with this effort. 10</td>', 'Excellent portrait.  Beautiful capture of a beautiful lady. I think you''ll be in the top 3 with this effort. 10', '2003-01-04 20:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(182458, 10114, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, but really feel like I want to see more of her face/expression.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, but really feel like I want to see more of her face/expression.', '2003-01-04 21:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(182460, 10129, 2553, '<td valign="top">I don''t really consider a photo of an inanimate object to be a portrait, however, <br/>that aside;  I like that you photographed it against negative space.  I like the basic composition, but would have preferred to see a tighter crop horizontally, probably cropping right below the lower "point" of the mane, or alternatively, a vertical shot showing the entire body.  The lighting is good, and it is a nice clear photo.</td>', 'I don''t really consider a photo of an inanimate object to be a portrait, however, that aside;  I like that you photographed it against negative space.  I like the basic composition, but would have preferred to see a tighter crop horizontally, probably cropping right below the lower "point" of the mane, or alternatively, a vertical shot showing the entire body.  The lighting is good, and it is a nice clear photo.', '2003-01-04 21:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(182471, 10263, 1031, '<td valign="top">Really like everything except the harshness of the light and the difference between the eyes especially; just don''t think it matches the composition and mood as well as it could.</td>', 'Really like everything except the harshness of the light and the difference between the eyes especially; just don''t think it matches the composition and mood as well as it could.', '2003-01-04 22:05:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(182478, 10221, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting and tone are about perfect; there''s maybe the teensiest bit of fringing on her sleeve in the lower left. Since the line of the hat brim and her fingers create a strong horizontal flow, I think I''d try cropping up higher, maybe halfway around the curve of her right shoulder, into a near-square or horizontal shape.</td>', 'Lighting and tone are about perfect; there''s maybe the teensiest bit of fringing on her sleeve in the lower left. Since the line of the hat brim and her fingers create a strong horizontal flow, I think I''d try cropping up higher, maybe halfway around the curve of her right shoulder, into a near-square or horizontal shape.', '2003-01-04 22:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(182496, 10269, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait portraying her ''feelings''.  Very nice photo.  7</td>', 'Excellent portrait portraying her ''feelings''.  Very nice photo.  7', '2003-01-04 23:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(182497, 10243, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent look!!  I love the idea of the scarf draped over her face showing her eyes, which I might add are beautiful.  Excellent photo.</td>', 'Excellent look!!  I love the idea of the scarf draped over her face showing her eyes, which I might add are beautiful.  Excellent photo.', '2003-01-04 23:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(182499, 10270, 1829, '<td valign="top">Lili is a beautiful cat.  The clarity is great on the cat, however the fluff at the front is a little distracting.  But overall a great portrait photo of your cat.  7</td>', 'Lili is a beautiful cat.  The clarity is great on the cat, however the fluff at the front is a little distracting.  But overall a great portrait photo of your cat.  7', '2003-01-04 23:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(182502, 10263, 1829, '<td valign="top">What a little sweety pie.  I love her expression.  The composition is great as well.  Great capture.</td>', 'What a little sweety pie.  I love her expression.  The composition is great as well.  Great capture.', '2003-01-04 23:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(182503, 10162, 1829, '<td valign="top">Looks like this little one is having lots of fun.  Great idea for a portrait shot.  The piano adds interest as well.  Great capture.</td>', 'Looks like this little one is having lots of fun.  Great idea for a portrait shot.  The piano adds interest as well.  Great capture.', '2003-01-04 23:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(182504, 10115, 1829, '<td valign="top">Wonderful self portrait shot.  It is showing me a lot of emotion by the way you are looking downwards with a sadened face.  Excellent shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful self portrait shot.  It is showing me a lot of emotion by the way you are looking downwards with a sadened face.  Excellent shot.  Well done.', '2003-01-04 23:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
