(182855, 10213, 4411, '<td valign="top">Takes the award for best looking model by a country mile. Great ''wind in the hair'' look, lovely dimple, focus is spot on with the background nicely blurred out. Only complaint is that the background is still a little too busy &amp; distracting. I find myself wondering what that white line running up from the left side is.<br/>Excellent work, well done.</td>', 'Takes the award for best looking model by a country mile. Great ''wind in the hair'' look, lovely dimple, focus is spot on with the background nicely blurred out. Only complaint is that the background is still a little too busy & distracting. I find myself wondering what that white line running up from the left side is.Excellent work, well done.', '2003-01-05 18:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
