(418772, 10310, 9504, '<td valign="top">Neat idea with the fan.  Great self-portrait!  I think a white background would have really set this photo off.  The wood grain in the back kind of takes away from it because it blends with your hair.  If we could distinguish your hair easier, it would add much more interst!</td>', 'Neat idea with the fan.  Great self-portrait!  I think a white background would have really set this photo off.  The wood grain in the back kind of takes away from it because it blends with your hair.  If we could distinguish your hair easier, it would add much more interst!', '2003-09-14 17:50:50.000000', NULL, 0),
