(1699896, 10267, 35142, '<td valign="top">"When you''re a Jet, you''re a Jet all the way..."<br/> <br/>This is a great self-portrait! I was rambling through some older challenges and remember stumbling upon this photo eons ago. What I enjoy about the crop is that the profile of the face is *almost* centered, but the viewer''s eye travels around the ''P'' shape made by the arm, getting the overall feel of the comp. Just had to make a drive-by comment =D</td>', '"When you''re a Jet, you''re a Jet all the way..." This is a great self-portrait! I was rambling through some older challenges and remember stumbling upon this photo eons ago. What I enjoy about the crop is that the profile of the face is *almost* centered, but the viewer''s eye travels around the ''P'' shape made by the arm, getting the overall feel of the comp. Just had to make a drive-by comment =D', '2005-09-12 15:57:21.000000', NULL, 0),
